(678495, 71329, 20102, '<td valign="top">Sorry for the "huh". What I meant to say, is that I don''t understand what this is. A flashlight? A bug? It just doesn''t say to me, "I''ve accidentally made a good discovery, and this is what it is."</td>', 'Sorry for the "huh". What I meant to say, is that I don''t understand what this is. A flashlight? A bug? It just doesn''t say to me, "I''ve accidentally made a good discovery, and this is what it is."', '2004-04-21 01:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(678496, 71231, 16420, '<td valign="top">Lovely capture of one of my favorite birds. My only suggestion would be to increase the saturation or hues just slightly. The yellow and green should really "pop" around the face. Would also like to see more of its face, as a portrait since they''re such expressive birds. Good luck with this one! I hope yo do well.</td>', 'Lovely capture of one of my favorite birds. My only suggestion would be to increase the saturation or hues just slightly. The yellow and green should really "pop" around the face. Would also like to see more of its face, as a portrait since they''re such expressive birds. Good luck with this one! I hope yo do well.', '2004-04-21 01:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(678502, 71228, 20102, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing your discovery was the lighting of this shot. Very nice capture!</td>', 'I''m guessing your discovery was the lighting of this shot. Very nice capture!', '2004-04-21 01:43:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(678504, 71308, 18960, '<td valign="top">This is an incredible picture. You did really well. I love the aquamarine color; a great composition for me because I like to see the water on the right side rolling over the edge, and I like that tiny peek through the mist to the other side. But I don''t think it''s serendipity -- the rainbow is always there.<br/> <br/>Now this was a serendipitous experience for me because I am so pleasantly surprised to have discovered your beautiful image -- of course I thought I would see nice pictures here, but I am amazed by yours.</td>', 'This is an incredible picture. You did really well. I love the aquamarine color; a great composition for me because I like to see the water on the right side rolling over the edge, and I like that tiny peek through the mist to the other side. But I don''t think it''s serendipity -- the rainbow is always there. Now this was a serendipitous experience for me because I am so pleasantly surprised to have discovered your beautiful image -- of course I thought I would see nice pictures here, but I am amazed by yours.', '2004-04-21 01:44:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(678509, 71193, 20102, '<td valign="top">How cute! Lucky for you to have a camera at a moment like this.</td>', 'How cute! Lucky for you to have a camera at a moment like this.', '2004-04-21 01:46:03.000000', NULL, 1),
