(679674, 70888, 19780, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors and shapes. I wish the little flowers were slightly more in focus but still sings of the idea of serendipity to me - finding gentle beauty in an unlikely place.</td>', 'Lovely colors and shapes. I wish the little flowers were slightly more in focus but still sings of the idea of serendipity to me - finding gentle beauty in an unlikely place.', '2004-04-21 16:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
