(679680, 71197, 19780, '<td valign="top">An interesting find and take on the idea of serendipity - the cat wanted a place to curl up that fit its body and the sink matched that. I like the black and white choice, I wish the other things weren''t in the top of the frame on the edge of the sink but otherwise a great photo and I put it in my top 5 for this assignment.</td>', 'An interesting find and take on the idea of serendipity - the cat wanted a place to curl up that fit its body and the sink matched that. I like the black and white choice, I wish the other things weren''t in the top of the frame on the edge of the sink but otherwise a great photo and I put it in my top 5 for this assignment.', '2004-04-21 16:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(679681, 70483, 19780, '<td valign="top">Overexposed on the face but an interesting pose. I found the flash reflection out the window most distracting and of course I''d love to see the eyes open.</td>', 'Overexposed on the face but an interesting pose. I found the flash reflection out the window most distracting and of course I''d love to see the eyes open.', '2004-04-21 16:20:20.000000', NULL, 1),
