(679685, 71262, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like the monochrome but I wish it was crisper looking. I''m not sure how it fits with serendipity but it is intriguing and could be improved wtih a slightly more interesting composition.</td>', 'I like the monochrome but I wish it was crisper looking. I''m not sure how it fits with serendipity but it is intriguing and could be improved wtih a slightly more interesting composition.', '2004-04-21 16:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
