(679711, 71332, 17126, '<td valign="top">?? This picture makes me laugh, i''m not sure why. Good lighting, nice subjects, but all in all it''s just a bunch of crap thrown together in a photograph. Where is the serendipity? If we have to ask, then the photograph is not doing its job in perveying the theme. You obviously have some awesome talent with lighting and placement and even some super props, so push a little harder... 3</td>', '?? This picture makes me laugh, i''m not sure why. Good lighting, nice subjects, but all in all it''s just a bunch of crap thrown together in a photograph. Where is the serendipity? If we have to ask, then the photograph is not doing its job in perveying the theme. You obviously have some awesome talent with lighting and placement and even some super props, so push a little harder... 3', '2004-04-21 16:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(679713, 70243, 17126, '<td valign="top">Man I''ve laughed at so many pictures in this competition. LOL - what the HECK? 5 for making me laugh, otherwise I see no serendipity here. Nice focus by the way.</td>', 'Man I''ve laughed at so many pictures in this competition. LOL - what the HECK? 5 for making me laugh, otherwise I see no serendipity here. Nice focus by the way.', '2004-04-21 16:41:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(679716, 70525, 17126, '<td valign="top">Now this is serendipity. Cool! I love the background too, just wish the foreground was lit a little better, but that probably was not under your cotrol. Nice find! 9 - because there are way too many in this competition that don''t even come close to ''serendipity'' the way yours does. kudos!<br/> <br/>Ok, I just looked at it again. I have reconsidered my thoughts on the foreground lighting. I like it now, the bluish hue contrasts nicely with the background.</td>', 'Now this is serendipity. Cool! I love the background too, just wish the foreground was lit a little better, but that probably was not under your cotrol. Nice find! 9 - because there are way too many in this competition that don''t even come close to ''serendipity'' the way yours does. kudos! Ok, I just looked at it again. I have reconsidered my thoughts on the foreground lighting. I like it now, the bluish hue contrasts nicely with the background.', '2004-04-21 16:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(679717, 71211, 18911, '<td valign="top">Too Small, Little detail, Nice colors</td>', 'Too Small, Little detail, Nice colors', '2004-04-21 16:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
