(679731, 70810, 20482, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot. The reflections in the drop of water are amazing.  This is one of my favorites so far, but how does it fall into this catagory?  Great Shot</td>', 'This is a great shot. The reflections in the drop of water are amazing.  This is one of my favorites so far, but how does it fall into this catagory?  Great Shot', '2004-04-21 16:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(679732, 70722, 14601, '<td valign="top">Serenity for sure, but serendipity? I don''t know. But the theme is nebulous enough to say, sure, why not? In that case you get a 10 from me for this superb photo. I can''t find anything that I would change. Great color and depth; composition is perfect, as is the exposure.</td>', 'Serenity for sure, but serendipity? I don''t know. But the theme is nebulous enough to say, sure, why not? In that case you get a 10 from me for this superb photo. I can''t find anything that I would change. Great color and depth; composition is perfect, as is the exposure.', '2004-04-21 16:51:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(679734, 70346, 17126, '<td valign="top">boring, trite, cliched, hackneyed, dull. 3<br/> <br/>By the way, I''m telling this to all the "money" pictures just because I think you should push yourself a little harder.   :)  Don''t take it personally. At least yours is in a book and not in the dirt. Hence the 3 instead of a 1.</td>', 'boring, trite, cliched, hackneyed, dull. 3 By the way, I''m telling this to all the "money" pictures just because I think you should push yourself a little harder.   :)  Don''t take it personally. At least yours is in a book and not in the dirt. Hence the 3 instead of a 1.', '2004-04-21 16:51:58.000000', NULL, 1);
