(679746, 70497, 17126, '<td valign="top">The only thing tying this into ''serendipity'' is the title, and I don''t believe you that it was a surprise visit. :)<br/> <br/>Did you honestly take this picture to fulfill the contest, or did you just look for a picture you already had and force it into a contest that''s completely unrelated? I hope it''s the latter, because I''d rather you be lazy than uncreative if you know what I mean. Push yourself, you have some great talent! Nice color, focus, and expression!    :)<br/> <br/>I meant everything in the nicest possible way...</td>', 'The only thing tying this into ''serendipity'' is the title, and I don''t believe you that it was a surprise visit. :) Did you honestly take this picture to fulfill the contest, or did you just look for a picture you already had and force it into a contest that''s completely unrelated? I hope it''s the latter, because I''d rather you be lazy than uncreative if you know what I mean. Push yourself, you have some great talent! Nice color, focus, and expression!    :) I meant everything in the nicest possible way...', '2004-04-21 16:57:04.000000', NULL, 1),
