(679758, 70986, 14601, '<td valign="top">It must be my eyes, because I spent several minutes looking for it, but still can''t find the hidden treasure. To me this is just a photo of some large rocks. On that basis, it''s an OK photo, but still doesn''t do much for me.</td>', 'It must be my eyes, because I spent several minutes looking for it, but still can''t find the hidden treasure. To me this is just a photo of some large rocks. On that basis, it''s an OK photo, but still doesn''t do much for me.', '2004-04-21 17:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
