(679821, 71269, 14601, '<td valign="top">Technically, fairly well executed. A few suggestions on this particular setup to make it more "real": 1) the "bite" doesn''t look like a bite - no teeth marks or jagged edges to it; 2) the penny is too flatly exposed and too shiny - it should be partially imbedded in the pulp and tarnished from the acid in the apple.</td>', 'Technically, fairly well executed. A few suggestions on this particular setup to make it more "real": 1) the "bite" doesn''t look like a bite - no teeth marks or jagged edges to it; 2) the penny is too flatly exposed and too shiny - it should be partially imbedded in the pulp and tarnished from the acid in the apple.', '2004-04-21 17:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
