(680068, 70786, 19780, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting idea but the staging needs a little work. The background does not benefit the photo - the colors of the floor are too close to the eggshell and lose the color of the yolk. The inside of the egg is overexposed and draws the eye away from the treasure, which is a shame.</td>', 'It''s an interesting idea but the staging needs a little work. The background does not benefit the photo - the colors of the floor are too close to the eggshell and lose the color of the yolk. The inside of the egg is overexposed and draws the eye away from the treasure, which is a shame.', '2004-04-21 18:56:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(680070, 71326, 16488, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I like the way the power lines play into the subject.   Light on the bird also helps create some of the success here.  It makes one think about the relationship of the made and natural worlds.  One of the nicest so far.</td>', 'Very nice!  I like the way the power lines play into the subject.   Light on the bird also helps create some of the success here.  It makes one think about the relationship of the made and natural worlds.  One of the nicest so far.', '2004-04-21 18:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(680073, 70629, 17033, '<td valign="top">Wow factor....right place at the right time. grainy effect suits. Up there with the best</td>', 'Wow factor....right place at the right time. grainy effect suits. Up there with the best', '2004-04-21 18:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(680074, 70583, 19780, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what this is, so I find it hard to vote. I like the colors but the are distracting scratches or streaks. I think I''d like more crispness to it and perhaps more context for what the subject is.</td>', 'I don''t know what this is, so I find it hard to vote. I like the colors but the are distracting scratches or streaks. I think I''d like more crispness to it and perhaps more context for what the subject is.', '2004-04-21 18:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(680083, 71270, 19780, '<td valign="top">I think your concept is very interesting (about Fleming''s discovery) but I would like to see the lemon more in focus than the other items in the foreground. Also, I think more items that would suggest a lab would help. I do like the background color though, I like how it contrasts the yellow and blue of the fruit.</td>', 'I think your concept is very interesting (about Fleming''s discovery) but I would like to see the lemon more in focus than the other items in the foreground. Also, I think more items that would suggest a lab would help. I do like the background color though, I like how it contrasts the yellow and blue of the fruit.', '2004-04-21 19:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(680087, 71270, 17033, '<td valign="top">I think it was bread mould not fruit mould? petri dish not obvious enough. books too flat..I like those text book pics where paper disks have been impregnated with various antibiotics and they are placed on petri dishes of growing bacteria...you see bacterial death spreading out from the disk</td>', 'I think it was bread mould not fruit mould? petri dish not obvious enough. books too flat..I like those text book pics where paper disks have been impregnated with various antibiotics and they are placed on petri dishes of growing bacteria...you see bacterial death spreading out from the disk', '2004-04-21 19:01:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(680088, 71308, 16488, '<td valign="top">Well, you already know you''re stretching a bit since there are rainbows at the Horseshoe Falls almost any sunny day..... But the subject is decently captured.  A lower point of view and the edge of the falls would have hidden the cast shadow on the mist.  Lucky you for being in one of my favorite spots this past week.</td>', 'Well, you already know you''re stretching a bit since there are rainbows at the Horseshoe Falls almost any sunny day..... But the subject is decently captured.  A lower point of view and the edge of the falls would have hidden the cast shadow on the mist.  Lucky you for being in one of my favorite spots this past week.', '2004-04-21 19:01:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(680090, 70495, 17033, '<td valign="top">let the pic do the talking!</td>', 'let the pic do the talking!', '2004-04-21 19:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(680096, 70863, 16488, '<td valign="top">The lack of focus on the divot fixer detracts from the overall effect.  In fact, I don''t think the object  needs to be there at all--it makes for a busy composition without seeming to add any important information.  Generally an inventive idea for the challenge.</td>', 'The lack of focus on the divot fixer detracts from the overall effect.  In fact, I don''t think the object  needs to be there at all--it makes for a busy composition without seeming to add any important information.  Generally an inventive idea for the challenge.', '2004-04-21 19:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(680097, 71185, 17033, '<td valign="top">Thought it was a camera at first...must be obsessed or something...a white teacup would be clearer..nice idea</td>', 'Thought it was a camera at first...must be obsessed or something...a white teacup would be clearer..nice idea', '2004-04-21 19:06:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(680099, 70657, 17033, '<td valign="top">at a loss</td>', 'at a loss', '2004-04-21 19:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(680103, 71267, 19780, '<td valign="top">It took me a while to figure this one out (with help from your title). Still, it''s not clear that there''s another fish in the mouth - it simply looks like this fish has a forked tongue (which would be an interesting find, actually). I would have liked to see if framed a little better to see that other fish in the mouth, and maybe pull back a little so we can see more of the larger fish (more of its eye, anyway) Good catch!</td>', 'It took me a while to figure this one out (with help from your title). Still, it''s not clear that there''s another fish in the mouth - it simply looks like this fish has a forked tongue (which would be an interesting find, actually). I would have liked to see if framed a little better to see that other fish in the mouth, and maybe pull back a little so we can see more of the larger fish (more of its eye, anyway) Good catch!', '2004-04-21 19:11:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(680106, 71107, 16488, '<td valign="top">This could be THE one!  Beautifully done!  I love the idea of the happy discovery of feeling rain fall on your face.</td>', 'This could be THE one!  Beautifully done!  I love the idea of the happy discovery of feeling rain fall on your face.', '2004-04-21 19:13:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(680114, 70422, 16488, '<td valign="top">Bit overexposed, lacks focus, and the horizon is tipped with no meaningful effect.  There''s so much more you might have done here!</td>', 'Bit overexposed, lacks focus, and the horizon is tipped with no meaningful effect.  There''s so much more you might have done here!', '2004-04-21 19:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(680115, 70645, 10799, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been better if there was a phrase or saying on the paper in the cookie that used the word serendipity instead of just the word as far as the creative aspect of the photo.  THe photo is well done.  I like all the crumbs.  I am not sure about the shadows they seem a bit harsh.</td>', 'I think it would have been better if there was a phrase or saying on the paper in the cookie that used the word serendipity instead of just the word as far as the creative aspect of the photo.  THe photo is well done.  I like all the crumbs.  I am not sure about the shadows they seem a bit harsh.', '2004-04-21 19:24:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(680121, 71149, 16488, '<td valign="top">The sun and tree really compete here--so much that your subject seems lost.  I can easily see why you attempted it and hope you''ll try for the subject again.</td>', 'The sun and tree really compete here--so much that your subject seems lost.  I can easily see why you attempted it and hope you''ll try for the subject again.', '2004-04-21 19:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(680123, 70604, 18709, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot.  I like the placing of  the statue on the far right-hand side even  though it leaves a lot of space ahead of him.  The sky is quite good.</td>', 'Excellent shot.  I like the placing of  the statue on the far right-hand side even  though it leaves a lot of space ahead of him.  The sky is quite good.', '2004-04-21 19:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(680125, 70653, 16488, '<td valign="top">Crisp!  You seem to have handled the focus perfectly, hard to do in close-ups like these.  I love that I can see the texture on the petals--don''t think I realized how much texture forsythia blossoms have before now.  Well done!</td>', 'Crisp!  You seem to have handled the focus perfectly, hard to do in close-ups like these.  I love that I can see the texture on the petals--don''t think I realized how much texture forsythia blossoms have before now.  Well done!', '2004-04-21 19:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(680128, 70583, 18719, '<td valign="top">wow nice  !!</td>', 'wow nice  !!', '2004-04-21 19:32:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(680131, 71257, 16488, '<td valign="top">As your title demonstrates, it helps if you know the story.  On its own, the colors are dramatic and the emblem well stated.  There seems to be something of a political comment here, the arches x-ing out the flag--intentional?</td>', 'As your title demonstrates, it helps if you know the story.  On its own, the colors are dramatic and the emblem well stated.  There seems to be something of a political comment here, the arches x-ing out the flag--intentional?', '2004-04-21 19:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(680136, 71324, 16488, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo.  I like the way the composition leads the eye.  The shadows give drama and bring out the textures in the scene.  As for the theme of the challenge, though, this seems somewhat unlucky for the boat and its owner as opposed to the happier, more fortunate, connotations associated with serendipity.</td>', 'Interesting photo.  I like the way the composition leads the eye.  The shadows give drama and bring out the textures in the scene.  As for the theme of the challenge, though, this seems somewhat unlucky for the boat and its owner as opposed to the happier, more fortunate, connotations associated with serendipity.', '2004-04-21 19:38:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(680137, 70842, 9462, '<td valign="top">EW! I think more like wrong place / wrong time... wounldn''t wanna get splashed by that nasty water.</td>', 'EW! I think more like wrong place / wrong time... wounldn''t wanna get splashed by that nasty water.', '2004-04-21 19:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(680141, 71232, 19116, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  It really fits the challenge.  I wonder how it would look in black and white? 8.</td>', 'Great idea.  It really fits the challenge.  I wonder how it would look in black and white? 8.', '2004-04-21 19:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(680143, 71211, 9462, '<td valign="top">This looks to be a really nice pic but it''s too small... sorry gotta take points away :(</td>', 'This looks to be a really nice pic but it''s too small... sorry gotta take points away :(', '2004-04-21 19:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(680145, 70438, 19116, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  Like the sepia a lot. 7.</td>', 'Good idea.  Like the sepia a lot. 7.', '2004-04-21 19:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(680146, 70281, 9462, '<td valign="top">Nothing really serendipitous here.... Wish the tree wasn''t so ''in the middle'' of the pic.</td>', 'Nothing really serendipitous here.... Wish the tree wasn''t so ''in the middle'' of the pic.', '2004-04-21 19:44:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(680149, 71270, 9462, '<td valign="top">Oh please stop studying and take out the trash!</td>', 'Oh please stop studying and take out the trash!', '2004-04-21 19:46:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(680150, 71218, 19116, '<td valign="top">Great color in this one.</td>', 'Great color in this one.', '2004-04-21 19:46:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(680151, 71284, 9462, '<td valign="top">LOL... cute</td>', 'LOL... cute', '2004-04-21 19:46:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(680156, 70769, 9462, '<td valign="top">Mm yes... the sun sets everyday... while it''s an ok shot... not really anything serendipitous about it. Just a plain ole sunset... Kinda... boring? Not trying to offend you, just giving my honest opinion :)</td>', 'Mm yes... the sun sets everyday... while it''s an ok shot... not really anything serendipitous about it. Just a plain ole sunset... Kinda... boring? Not trying to offend you, just giving my honest opinion :)', '2004-04-21 19:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(680159, 71284, 14614, '<td valign="top">very nice capture!  your dof and lighting have brought out the specialness of the moment.</td>', 'very nice capture!  your dof and lighting have brought out the specialness of the moment.', '2004-04-21 19:52:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(680160, 70695, 10799, '<td valign="top">The diamonds don''t seem very clear in this photo... there seems to be a reflection on the right side but the diamonds don''t stand out enough from the metal to really see them.  Maybe the focus was off a bit.  Perhaps if the ring(?) were closer it would have stood out more.</td>', 'The diamonds don''t seem very clear in this photo... there seems to be a reflection on the right side but the diamonds don''t stand out enough from the metal to really see them.  Maybe the focus was off a bit.  Perhaps if the ring(?) were closer it would have stood out more.', '2004-04-21 19:52:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(680161, 70998, 19116, '<td valign="top">Really like this picture.  The reflection works  well.  Not real applicable to the challenge though...</td>', 'Really like this picture.  The reflection works  well.  Not real applicable to the challenge though...', '2004-04-21 19:52:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(680163, 70438, 16488, '<td valign="top">Funny!  And they say in the threads that cemetarys don''t make for good photos!  I do think you could have lowered the point of view to exclude some of the grass and bring the subjects closer together, though.  Sepia tone isn''t my favorite picture element, it seems a bit overused in general in DPC, but in this pic it does help to unify the whole--B&amp;W might have done the same.</td>', 'Funny!  And they say in the threads that cemetarys don''t make for good photos!  I do think you could have lowered the point of view to exclude some of the grass and bring the subjects closer together, though.  Sepia tone isn''t my favorite picture element, it seems a bit overused in general in DPC, but in this pic it does help to unify the whole--B&W might have done the same.', '2004-04-21 19:54:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(680164, 70482, 10799, '<td valign="top">You might try this a different time of day.  The sky is too bright and the flowers seem too bright too... not enough detail in them.  Also, if you follow the rule of thirds it helps the dynamics of the photo... it seems a bit stagnant as it is.  I like the bent flower that seems to be joining the angel in prayer.</td>', 'You might try this a different time of day.  The sky is too bright and the flowers seem too bright too... not enough detail in them.  Also, if you follow the rule of thirds it helps the dynamics of the photo... it seems a bit stagnant as it is.  I like the bent flower that seems to be joining the angel in prayer.', '2004-04-21 19:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(680165, 70815, 9462, '<td valign="top">Yes... quite unexpected. <br/>Wish the bottom wasn''t cropped off.</td>', 'Yes... quite unexpected. Wish the bottom wasn''t cropped off.', '2004-04-21 19:56:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(680166, 71113, 14614, '<td valign="top">Yowza!  This is quite "in the moment"  Sure grabs my attention; only suggestion is a tighter crop -- although I''m not really sure I want to be any closer ;)</td>', 'Yowza!  This is quite "in the moment"  Sure grabs my attention; only suggestion is a tighter crop -- although I''m not really sure I want to be any closer ;)', '2004-04-21 19:56:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(680168, 70629, 10799, '<td valign="top">I like the perspective.  Did you try a noise removal program ... I think it would help make this shot better.</td>', 'I like the perspective.  Did you try a noise removal program ... I think it would help make this shot better.', '2004-04-21 19:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(680169, 71246, 14614, '<td valign="top">the glowing hair moves this into the art category for me; I''d like to see the shot with a tighter crop around the subject (and perhaps more of the leaves since it''s in the title)</td>', 'the glowing hair moves this into the art category for me; I''d like to see the shot with a tighter crop around the subject (and perhaps more of the leaves since it''s in the title)', '2004-04-21 19:57:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(680171, 71094, 9462, '<td valign="top">Too bad it''s closed.</td>', 'Too bad it''s closed.', '2004-04-21 19:58:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(680172, 71300, 14614, '<td valign="top">this is well done!  excellent lighting and dof with the surprise on top.</td>', 'this is well done!  excellent lighting and dof with the surprise on top.', '2004-04-21 19:58:43.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(680173, 71208, 16488, '<td valign="top">Great concept!  Set up well so the strand of pearls seems more like individual pearls--a mouthful of pearly whites, as it may be.  I don''t care for your choice of background, perhaps something less sterile.   Also, a secondary light source might take some of the harshness out of the shadows--it just feels a bit too unnatural overall.</td>', 'Great concept!  Set up well so the strand of pearls seems more like individual pearls--a mouthful of pearly whites, as it may be.  I don''t care for your choice of background, perhaps something less sterile.   Also, a secondary light source might take some of the harshness out of the shadows--it just feels a bit too unnatural overall.', '2004-04-21 19:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(680174, 70722, 9462, '<td valign="top">Wish it was level.</td>', 'Wish it was level.', '2004-04-21 19:59:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(680180, 71285, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very nice clear shot. Wouldn''t it be nice if money really did grow on trees.</td>', 'Very nice clear shot. Wouldn''t it be nice if money really did grow on trees.', '2004-04-21 20:07:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(680182, 71208, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture. It illustrates serendipity well, you might expect to find one pearl but not a whole necklace. The color of the background and angle of the shot really work well with this subject.</td>', 'Very nice picture. It illustrates serendipity well, you might expect to find one pearl but not a whole necklace. The color of the background and angle of the shot really work well with this subject.', '2004-04-21 20:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(680183, 71108, 18552, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. The clarity and focus are great. I don''t know if I like the color, it''s neither B&amp;W, sepia or true color.  However, it does seem to go with the picture quite well.</td>', 'Excellent shot. The clarity and focus are great. I don''t know if I like the color, it''s neither B&W, sepia or true color.  However, it does seem to go with the picture quite well.', '2004-04-21 20:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(680184, 71296, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very cute serendipitous find.</td>', 'Very cute serendipitous find.', '2004-04-21 20:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(680186, 71312, 10799, '<td valign="top">Have you tried a noise removal program on this... it seems to have noise in it.</td>', 'Have you tried a noise removal program on this... it seems to have noise in it.', '2004-04-21 20:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(680187, 71231, 14614, '<td valign="top">I don''t quite see the Serendipity here.  This is such a fine shot that I''d like to hear how you see it (if you don''t want to pm me -- that''s fine -- I''ll go with the shot alone but a disconnect with the theme)</td>', 'I don''t quite see the Serendipity here.  This is such a fine shot that I''d like to hear how you see it (if you don''t want to pm me -- that''s fine -- I''ll go with the shot alone but a disconnect with the theme)', '2004-04-21 20:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(680189, 71305, 18552, '<td valign="top">Clever idea. It will be very interesting to read after the challenge how you did this, I can''t think how it must have been done. Since your picture has been validated, it must be something legal! Nice color and focus. I think the border really does enhance your picture.</td>', 'Clever idea. It will be very interesting to read after the challenge how you did this, I can''t think how it must have been done. Since your picture has been validated, it must be something legal! Nice color and focus. I think the border really does enhance your picture.', '2004-04-21 20:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(680192, 71188, 18552, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture. I guess the serendipity lies in having found the pop machine on a hot day. It must be un-serendipity that it''s out of order! Nice clear shot taken from a good angle.</td>', 'Interesting picture. I guess the serendipity lies in having found the pop machine on a hot day. It must be un-serendipity that it''s out of order! Nice clear shot taken from a good angle.', '2004-04-21 20:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(680194, 71185, 10799, '<td valign="top">Are you reading the tea leaves?  Interesting take on the challenge.</td>', 'Are you reading the tea leaves?  Interesting take on the challenge.', '2004-04-21 20:17:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(680197, 71082, 14614, '<td valign="top">very well exposed -- would make a great advert.</td>', 'very well exposed -- would make a great advert.', '2004-04-21 20:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(680198, 71230, 14614, '<td valign="top">excellent idea -- a bit more light would really have it all!</td>', 'excellent idea -- a bit more light would really have it all!', '2004-04-21 20:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(680199, 70687, 18552, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure what is supposed to be serendipitous about your picture. It is a disturbing picture.</td>', 'I''m not really sure what is supposed to be serendipitous about your picture. It is a disturbing picture.', '2004-04-21 20:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(680201, 70583, 18552, '<td valign="top">It might be serendipity because I can''t figure out what it is! Very curious and unusual picture.</td>', 'It might be serendipity because I can''t figure out what it is! Very curious and unusual picture.', '2004-04-21 20:20:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(680205, 70324, 14614, '<td valign="top">lovely lighting -- you''ve got it just right here!</td>', 'lovely lighting -- you''ve got it just right here!', '2004-04-21 20:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(680207, 71102, 18552, '<td valign="top">Cute picture and title. I''ve never seen a black squirrel, they are all gray around here. The color and focus on your picture are very nice.</td>', 'Cute picture and title. I''ve never seen a black squirrel, they are all gray around here. The color and focus on your picture are very nice.', '2004-04-21 20:22:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(680208, 70645, 13937, '<td valign="top">Excellent illustration of the theme!  Nice lighting.<br/></td>', 'Excellent illustration of the theme!  Nice lighting.', '2004-04-21 20:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(680212, 71280, 18552, '<td valign="top">Nice picture. I like the way the candy and hand are in focus and the couch isn''t. I seem to find more potato chip crumbs in my couch than candy - they aren''t nearly so photogenic!</td>', 'Nice picture. I like the way the candy and hand are in focus and the couch isn''t. I seem to find more potato chip crumbs in my couch than candy - they aren''t nearly so photogenic!', '2004-04-21 20:25:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(680215, 71277, 15152, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wild! Looks like a jackson pollack painting. I like how the texture of the water is unbroken across the full frame with just enough variation to make it interesting. <br/></td>', 'Absolutely wild! Looks like a jackson pollack painting. I like how the texture of the water is unbroken across the full frame with just enough variation to make it interesting. ', '2004-04-21 20:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(680223, 70998, 10799, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand.  I have kept coming back to this again and again and I stilll don''t see anything I can recognize....hmmmm the only suggestion I have is for the main idea to be more clear.....</td>', 'I don''t understand.  I have kept coming back to this again and again and I stilll don''t see anything I can recognize....hmmmm the only suggestion I have is for the main idea to be more clear.....', '2004-04-21 20:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(680227, 71300, 15152, '<td valign="top">I like the tonal range in the choice of copper colors. Did you pick these particual pennies or were they randomly chosen? I also like the placement of the "heads up" penny and the angle of teh shot. It looks like they''re sliding off the page. Just enough of a strange perspective to be interesting. Great shot.</td>', 'I like the tonal range in the choice of copper colors. Did you pick these particual pennies or were they randomly chosen? I also like the placement of the "heads up" penny and the angle of teh shot. It looks like they''re sliding off the page. Just enough of a strange perspective to be interesting. Great shot.', '2004-04-21 20:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(680228, 70497, 14986, '<td valign="top">My daughter''s favorite musician....she''d give it a 50 if she could!   Nice shot.</td>', 'My daughter''s favorite musician....she''d give it a 50 if she could!   Nice shot.', '2004-04-21 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(680232, 71197, 18098, '<td valign="top">A cat alseep in a wet sink.  Now that''s funny!</td>', 'A cat alseep in a wet sink.  Now that''s funny!', '2004-04-21 20:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(680234, 71107, 15152, '<td valign="top">I like how the red rain coat stands out from the rest of the photo. Good framing and I like the shadow that appears under her feet. I would have given it an even highter score if the jacket had bit a bit sharper. Great shot.</td>', 'I like how the red rain coat stands out from the rest of the photo. Good framing and I like the shadow that appears under her feet. I would have given it an even highter score if the jacket had bit a bit sharper. Great shot.', '2004-04-21 20:34:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(680235, 70832, 14986, '<td valign="top">Cute.  I think the lighting seems kind of flat here.  There''s no sparkle to the stones and it seems to be too bright.</td>', 'Cute.  I think the lighting seems kind of flat here.  There''s no sparkle to the stones and it seems to be too bright.', '2004-04-21 20:34:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(680238, 70629, 15152, '<td valign="top">What a wonderfuly simple shot. I like the grainy texture. The plane is very small in the shot but that''s what I like about it; you have to take a second look to make sure it really is a plane. Great perspective with the straight contrails and the shadow on the water.</td>', 'What a wonderfuly simple shot. I like the grainy texture. The plane is very small in the shot but that''s what I like about it; you have to take a second look to make sure it really is a plane. Great perspective with the straight contrails and the shadow on the water.', '2004-04-21 20:37:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(680239, 71270, 12151, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  However, the meaning of this photo is probably lost on a lot of people who don'' know the history of penicillin...</td>', 'Nice composition.  However, the meaning of this photo is probably lost on a lot of people who don'' know the history of penicillin...', '2004-04-21 20:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
