(680527, 71291, 10799, '<td valign="top">one time I had my camera and TWO deer almost ran right over me and I never got a shot of them... I guess I was too scared.  I had thought the noise was our dog and did not pay attention until the deer were right beside me.  This is a great capture.  Too bad you couldn''t ask the deer to move into a clearing!</td>', 'one time I had my camera and TWO deer almost ran right over me and I never got a shot of them... I guess I was too scared.  I had thought the noise was our dog and did not pay attention until the deer were right beside me.  This is a great capture.  Too bad you couldn''t ask the deer to move into a clearing!', '2004-04-21 22:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
