(680996, 71308, 14601, '<td valign="top">While a rainbow is not exactly serendipitous at this location, this is a nice shot of the falls. If you can, experiment with different aperture / shutter speed combinations and try with a polarizing filter, too.</td>', 'While a rainbow is not exactly serendipitous at this location, this is a nice shot of the falls. If you can, experiment with different aperture / shutter speed combinations and try with a polarizing filter, too.', '2004-04-22 09:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(680997, 71225, 14601, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture - hope you were using a long lens. Difficult shot considering the exposure range - you did well to capture the detail in the reptile without blowing out the highlights on the surrounding rocks.</td>', 'Very nice capture - hope you were using a long lens. Difficult shot considering the exposure range - you did well to capture the detail in the reptile without blowing out the highlights on the surrounding rocks.', '2004-04-22 09:19:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(680999, 71164, 14601, '<td valign="top">Nice entry for the theme of this challenge. I like, too, how you''ve chosen to frame/crop the photo. Nice.</td>', 'Nice entry for the theme of this challenge. I like, too, how you''ve chosen to frame/crop the photo. Nice.', '2004-04-22 09:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(681001, 71274, 14601, '<td valign="top">Nice selection for the theme of this challenge. Nice photo regardless of the challenge - I could see this accompanying an article in almost any contemporary newspaper / magazine - it''s very photo-journalistic in nature. Great capture.</td>', 'Nice selection for the theme of this challenge. Nice photo regardless of the challenge - I could see this accompanying an article in almost any contemporary newspaper / magazine - it''s very photo-journalistic in nature. Great capture.', '2004-04-22 09:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(681002, 71107, 14601, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how serendipitous this is, but I really like the photograph. I could see this as one of those "human interest" photos in a daily paper. I do like the use of negative space. Nice capture.</td>', 'I don''t know how serendipitous this is, but I really like the photograph. I could see this as one of those "human interest" photos in a daily paper. I do like the use of negative space. Nice capture.', '2004-04-22 09:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(681012, 70711, 20516, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting subject matter.  The only thing that bothers me is it seems like the focus is soft and it needed to be sharp to really "pop"</td>', 'This is an interesting subject matter.  The only thing that bothers me is it seems like the focus is soft and it needed to be sharp to really "pop"', '2004-04-22 09:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(681017, 70422, 14601, '<td valign="top">(editorial: Always bothers me to see kids doing this without any safety equipment ( kneepads, elbowpads, helmets, etc. )) I think that the shot would have been better with a shorter Depth of Field, and the exposure is a little flat, but that can probably be improved with some editing. Composition is good, and you''ve caught the action very nicely.</td>', '(editorial: Always bothers me to see kids doing this without any safety equipment ( kneepads, elbowpads, helmets, etc. )) I think that the shot would have been better with a shorter Depth of Field, and the exposure is a little flat, but that can probably be improved with some editing. Composition is good, and you''ve caught the action very nicely.', '2004-04-22 09:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(681054, 70764, 20135, '<td valign="top">Clever photo, nice effect, just about meets what I mean by serendipity. I would say there is a little too much darkness going on at the bottom of the image, possibly would have framed/ cropped.</td>', 'Clever photo, nice effect, just about meets what I mean by serendipity. I would say there is a little too much darkness going on at the bottom of the image, possibly would have framed/ cropped.', '2004-04-22 10:46:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(681056, 71270, 20135, '<td valign="top">The title validates the photo, I''m not sure the image does (Unless that is penicillin in the background?) I think more emphasis should have been on the petri (?) dish.</td>', 'The title validates the photo, I''m not sure the image does (Unless that is penicillin in the background?) I think more emphasis should have been on the petri (?) dish.', '2004-04-22 10:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(681057, 70483, 19841, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of millions of snapshots I have seen taken at frat parties.   Challenge yourself: disable that flash.</td>', 'This reminds me of millions of snapshots I have seen taken at frat parties.   Challenge yourself: disable that flash.', '2004-04-22 10:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
