(682153, 71037, 9668, '<td valign="top">Nice composition (the racecar being diagonal and not centered), I like how it is taken from above. The motion blur does a good job to show the bustle in this store(?).</td>', 'Nice composition (the racecar being diagonal and not centered), I like how it is taken from above. The motion blur does a good job to show the bustle in this store(?).', '2004-04-23 01:43:57.000000', NULL, 1),
