(682163, 71306, 9668, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what the white stuff is on the leaves, but it seems overexposed and unnatural. I like the shadows produced by the subject, but the background is a little distracting. Not quite sure how this is a serendipity, but I won''t mark you down for it.</td>', 'I don''t know what the white stuff is on the leaves, but it seems overexposed and unnatural. I like the shadows produced by the subject, but the background is a little distracting. Not quite sure how this is a serendipity, but I won''t mark you down for it.', '2004-04-23 01:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
