(682297, 70321, 20135, '<td valign="top">From a photographic point of view, the image seems to be sufering with some excessive noise, flare from the sun near the bird''s face which is very distracting and an awful lot of chromatic abberation. Also as you would expect a creature of this nature to be in a lake, I cannot see how this is serendipitous.</td>', 'From a photographic point of view, the image seems to be sufering with some excessive noise, flare from the sun near the bird''s face which is very distracting and an awful lot of chromatic abberation. Also as you would expect a creature of this nature to be in a lake, I cannot see how this is serendipitous.', '2004-04-23 06:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
