(682301, 71299, 20135, '<td valign="top">I think this is quite a clever photo - it fits the serendipity title purely on the surprised expression on the guy''s face, whilst the photo gives the impression of it being candid or ''taken on the fly'' whilst I suspect it was set up. I think I would have possibly has the party notice slightly fuller in the frame, where it stands is neither here nor there.</td>', 'I think this is quite a clever photo - it fits the serendipity title purely on the surprised expression on the guy''s face, whilst the photo gives the impression of it being candid or ''taken on the fly'' whilst I suspect it was set up. I think I would have possibly has the party notice slightly fuller in the frame, where it stands is neither here nor there.', '2004-04-23 06:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(682302, 71330, 20135, '<td valign="top">Unfortunate typo in the title, I am guessing the serendipity comes from the bush being able to sustain life and beauty despite being burnt out. Rather tenuous and not obvious without the title, but quite a nice image nevertheless, although photographically nothing stunning.</td>', 'Unfortunate typo in the title, I am guessing the serendipity comes from the bush being able to sustain life and beauty despite being burnt out. Rather tenuous and not obvious without the title, but quite a nice image nevertheless, although photographically nothing stunning.', '2004-04-23 06:22:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(682304, 70422, 20135, '<td valign="top">Cannot see where the serendipity lies, unless it is the skaters'' capacity to seek thrills on objects that are not being used for their intended purpose (Which the title doesn''t suggest). The image suffers from not being totally sharp on the subject and the guy on the left having the top of his head cropped out. And the horizon is wonky.</td>', 'Cannot see where the serendipity lies, unless it is the skaters'' capacity to seek thrills on objects that are not being used for their intended purpose (Which the title doesn''t suggest). The image suffers from not being totally sharp on the subject and the guy on the left having the top of his head cropped out. And the horizon is wonky.', '2004-04-23 06:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(682307, 71205, 20135, '<td valign="top">I love the title and I think the image is quite well taken, the washing maching white bit (Sorry not familiar with layout of canadian washers!)  is quite distracting but I suppose necessary to show it is a washing machine. The problem I have is deciding whether this is serendipity. If you have discovered the notes by accident then yes, if you have washed your hard earned cash and possibly ruined it then no. <br/>I will give you the benefit of the doubt and go for the latter!</td>', 'I love the title and I think the image is quite well taken, the washing maching white bit (Sorry not familiar with layout of canadian washers!)  is quite distracting but I suppose necessary to show it is a washing machine. The problem I have is deciding whether this is serendipity. If you have discovered the notes by accident then yes, if you have washed your hard earned cash and possibly ruined it then no. I will give you the benefit of the doubt and go for the latter!', '2004-04-23 06:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
