(682314, 71107, 20135, '<td valign="top">Love this idea for this photo, the colours on the girl''s coat contrast wonderfully on the grey of the tarmac and her being off centre in the frame works well. The facial expression is superb and I think the serendipity is met by the girl taking pleasure in something we would normally find depressing. <br/>The two negatives I have is thay it is hard to tell on a small image but the girl does not appear to be pin sharp and the large shadow surrouding her (Is it the photograher''s?) is distracting.</td>', 'Love this idea for this photo, the colours on the girl''s coat contrast wonderfully on the grey of the tarmac and her being off centre in the frame works well. The facial expression is superb and I think the serendipity is met by the girl taking pleasure in something we would normally find depressing. The two negatives I have is thay it is hard to tell on a small image but the girl does not appear to be pin sharp and the large shadow surrouding her (Is it the photograher''s?) is distracting.', '2004-04-23 06:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(682316, 71342, 20135, '<td valign="top">I''d love to know what you have done here! This image is saved by the title, the bottom right of the picture sadly disputes whether you were strolling through a park!</td>', 'I''d love to know what you have done here! This image is saved by the title, the bottom right of the picture sadly disputes whether you were strolling through a park!', '2004-04-23 06:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
