(682580, 71300, 19780, '<td valign="top">A very interesting take on the idea of serendipity. I like the composition, though I wish not all the pennies were showing their obverse side, though I can understand that you wanted to show that they weren''t wheat pennies. Nice color balance. Very coppery.</td>', 'A very interesting take on the idea of serendipity. I like the composition, though I wish not all the pennies were showing their obverse side, though I can understand that you wanted to show that they weren''t wheat pennies. Nice color balance. Very coppery.', '2004-04-23 13:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
