(682584, 70495, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice heron.</td>', 'Nice heron.', '2004-04-23 13:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(682586, 71331, 19780, '<td valign="top">Of all the staged shots,  this one worked the best for me. It''s clear that it''s a happy accident and the nature of the accident is well dramatized. The cropping is a little odd - I''d like to see it either closer or further away.</td>', 'Of all the staged shots,  this one worked the best for me. It''s clear that it''s a happy accident and the nature of the accident is well dramatized. The cropping is a little odd - I''d like to see it either closer or further away.', '2004-04-23 13:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(682587, 70321, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice grebe, not sure of serendipity though, maybe the sparkles.</td>', 'Nice grebe, not sure of serendipity though, maybe the sparkles.', '2004-04-23 13:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(682588, 70629, 3569, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, but a bit too grainy for my tastes.</td>', 'Cool shot, but a bit too grainy for my tastes.', '2004-04-23 13:52:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(682589, 70876, 19780, '<td valign="top">A lovely shot, I enjoy the varigated leaf and dappled light. I would love a bit sharper detaile on the leaves. I didn''t quite see how this fit into serendipity, but I didn''t allow that to interrupt my enjoyment of the colors and delight in spring.</td>', 'A lovely shot, I enjoy the varigated leaf and dappled light. I would love a bit sharper detaile on the leaves. I didn''t quite see how this fit into serendipity, but I didn''t allow that to interrupt my enjoyment of the colors and delight in spring.', '2004-04-23 13:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(682590, 70874, 3569, '<td valign="top">Wonderful eagle.  Not sure of the serendipity unless this is a wild bird and it just happened.</td>', 'Wonderful eagle.  Not sure of the serendipity unless this is a wild bird and it just happened.', '2004-04-23 13:53:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(682592, 71312, 19780, '<td valign="top">I wanted to like this photo more, I like the scale of the bumble bee to the flowers, but it''s rather grainy and the composition is just slightly off if the bee is to the be focus. It must have been a very fun shoot.</td>', 'I wanted to like this photo more, I like the scale of the bumble bee to the flowers, but it''s rather grainy and the composition is just slightly off if the bee is to the be focus. It must have been a very fun shoot.', '2004-04-23 13:54:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(682594, 70897, 3569, '<td valign="top">Wonderful macro.  Nice subject and colors are quite nice.  Great shot.</td>', 'Wonderful macro.  Nice subject and colors are quite nice.  Great shot.', '2004-04-23 13:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(682595, 71246, 3569, '<td valign="top">I love the boys curles and red cheeks.  Nice shot</td>', 'I love the boys curles and red cheeks.  Nice shot', '2004-04-23 13:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(682597, 71314, 19780, '<td valign="top">An interesting setting and lighting. Without your title, I have no reference for whether this is a common style for this neighborhood, or if it''s out of place (but welcome) so the serendipity part is lost on me. I like the lanterns and the overall composition with the angle of the balcony and branches framing the top. I think I would crop it slightly on the left to heighten that.</td>', 'An interesting setting and lighting. Without your title, I have no reference for whether this is a common style for this neighborhood, or if it''s out of place (but welcome) so the serendipity part is lost on me. I like the lanterns and the overall composition with the angle of the balcony and branches framing the top. I think I would crop it slightly on the left to heighten that.', '2004-04-23 13:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(682599, 71044, 19780, '<td valign="top">An interesting photo - the hand in the foreground feels overexposed and gives an odd sense of persepctive to the shot since it''s so much larger. I don''t mind staged shots such as this, but I''d like to see the bills integrated into the branches more organically (as if they''ve grown like leaves, perhaps). Great idea.</td>', 'An interesting photo - the hand in the foreground feels overexposed and gives an odd sense of persepctive to the shot since it''s so much larger. I don''t mind staged shots such as this, but I''d like to see the bills integrated into the branches more organically (as if they''ve grown like leaves, perhaps). Great idea.', '2004-04-23 14:01:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(682600, 70786, 3569, '<td valign="top">Great and cleaver Idea.  The shot is very good also...</td>', 'Great and cleaver Idea.  The shot is very good also...', '2004-04-23 14:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(682601, 70653, 3569, '<td valign="top">Fits the challenge well.  Nice capture.</td>', 'Fits the challenge well.  Nice capture.', '2004-04-23 14:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(682602, 70665, 19780, '<td valign="top">I really like this composition, how wonderful it was that you found this tree in full bloom. I think it could be cropped slightly at the top and perhaps the contrast heightened, but a lovely, compelling photo.</td>', 'I really like this composition, how wonderful it was that you found this tree in full bloom. I think it could be cropped slightly at the top and perhaps the contrast heightened, but a lovely, compelling photo.', '2004-04-23 14:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(682604, 70790, 3569, '<td valign="top">That ull buy some more chew....</td>', 'That ull buy some more chew....', '2004-04-23 14:04:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(682609, 71256, 19670, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t look like it''s really hidden...how does it meet the challenge?</td>', 'It doesn''t look like it''s really hidden...how does it meet the challenge?', '2004-04-23 14:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(682611, 70608, 19670, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t see how it meets the challenge. The caption might provide context that you happened to be somewhere and were able you got this shot, but if that''s the challenge criterion, couldn''t ANY picture meet the challenge?</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t see how it meets the challenge. The caption might provide context that you happened to be somewhere and were able you got this shot, but if that''s the challenge criterion, couldn''t ANY picture meet the challenge?', '2004-04-23 14:22:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(682612, 71239, 19670, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t see how it meets the challenge. The caption might provide context that you happened to be somewhere and were able you got this shot, but if that''s the challenge criterion, couldn''t ANY picture meet the challenge?</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t see how it meets the challenge. The caption might provide context that you happened to be somewhere and were able you got this shot, but if that''s the challenge criterion, couldn''t ANY picture meet the challenge?', '2004-04-23 14:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(682613, 70695, 19780, '<td valign="top">An interesting photo - I like the depth of focus, though I find the ring to be out of focus slightly and so I missed it the first time I looked at this shot. I love hte little bits of fibers in the nest as well, which adds to the idea that this bird collected things, including this ring.</td>', 'An interesting photo - I like the depth of focus, though I find the ring to be out of focus slightly and so I missed it the first time I looked at this shot. I love hte little bits of fibers in the nest as well, which adds to the idea that this bird collected things, including this ring.', '2004-04-23 14:23:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(682621, 70722, 17446, '<td valign="top">nice composition.  pleasing to the eye.</td>', 'nice composition.  pleasing to the eye.', '2004-04-23 14:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(682628, 70863, 9780, '<td valign="top">ahh... to dark IMO. But I like the setup  8</td>', 'ahh... to dark IMO. But I like the setup  8', '2004-04-23 14:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(682638, 71149, 9462, '<td valign="top">The cloud formations are very cool. And the silhouette of the tree adds a bit but i think had you studied it a bit more you could''ve done better with your composition.</td>', 'The cloud formations are very cool. And the silhouette of the tree adds a bit but i think had you studied it a bit more you could''ve done better with your composition.', '2004-04-23 15:03:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(682639, 70954, 9462, '<td valign="top">While it''s somewhat intriguing to think that plant life will overcome anything we build which becomes dilapidated. This isn''t really portraying anything serendipitous. It''s rather flat... a different angle might help.</td>', 'While it''s somewhat intriguing to think that plant life will overcome anything we build which becomes dilapidated. This isn''t really portraying anything serendipitous. It''s rather flat... a different angle might help.', '2004-04-23 15:07:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(682642, 70723, 9462, '<td valign="top">Yes. Quite lucky... but rather boring as a photo. I need some kind of vista.</td>', 'Yes. Quite lucky... but rather boring as a photo. I need some kind of vista.', '2004-04-23 15:10:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(682645, 71083, 9462, '<td valign="top">Humorous qualities...  Serendipitous that so many are living on Hope street? Dunno... Kind of a stretch. But it could be relevant because not too many ppl I know take their camera with them to check the mail.<br/>I like that it has a ''real'' feel to it.</td>', 'Humorous qualities...  Serendipitous that so many are living on Hope street? Dunno... Kind of a stretch. But it could be relevant because not too many ppl I know take their camera with them to check the mail.I like that it has a ''real'' feel to it.', '2004-04-23 15:16:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(682649, 71305, 9462, '<td valign="top">I''m anxious to see how this was done. I''ll have to read up on the discovery of Xrays. <br/>Nicely done ;)</td>', 'I''m anxious to see how this was done. I''ll have to read up on the discovery of Xrays. Nicely done ;)', '2004-04-23 15:20:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(682657, 70242, 9462, '<td valign="top">This is a really good shot. I like the contrast between the stem / background and the very vivid bud. But is it relevant to the theme of Serendipity? Not so much in my mind.</td>', 'This is a really good shot. I like the contrast between the stem / background and the very vivid bud. But is it relevant to the theme of Serendipity? Not so much in my mind.', '2004-04-23 15:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(682659, 70943, 9462, '<td valign="top">Perfect! That has to be one of the goofiest looks I''ve seen.<br/>Not quite as sharp as i''d like.</td>', 'Perfect! That has to be one of the goofiest looks I''ve seen.Not quite as sharp as i''d like.', '2004-04-23 15:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(682661, 70711, 9462, '<td valign="top">What an interesting idea... The shaodows and angle aren''t complimentary.</td>', 'What an interesting idea... The shaodows and angle aren''t complimentary.', '2004-04-23 15:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(682665, 71202, 9462, '<td valign="top">Hmm...  Pretty but typical, IMO.</td>', 'Hmm...  Pretty but typical, IMO.', '2004-04-23 15:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(682668, 71234, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice tones in this greyscale. Good sense of being at one with nature.</td>', 'Nice tones in this greyscale. Good sense of being at one with nature.', '2004-04-23 15:38:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(682670, 71186, 9462, '<td valign="top">Not really what I''m looking for in this challenge.</td>', 'Not really what I''m looking for in this challenge.', '2004-04-23 15:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(682671, 71305, 5792, '<td valign="top">Well created image with visual impact.</td>', 'Well created image with visual impact.', '2004-04-23 15:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(682673, 71300, 5792, '<td valign="top">Lighting, composition and framing are all top notch. Very high technical quality. A top three image in my opinion.</td>', 'Lighting, composition and framing are all top notch. Very high technical quality. A top three image in my opinion.', '2004-04-23 15:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(682674, 71204, 9462, '<td valign="top">A feather caught on a branch... Serendipity?</td>', 'A feather caught on a branch... Serendipity?', '2004-04-23 15:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(682675, 70998, 5792, '<td valign="top">Excellent technical quality in this black and white image.</td>', 'Excellent technical quality in this black and white image.', '2004-04-23 15:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(682676, 70629, 5792, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture of a view not often seen.</td>', 'Wonderful capture of a view not often seen.', '2004-04-23 15:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(682679, 70521, 5792, '<td valign="top">Excellent greyscale capture.</td>', 'Excellent greyscale capture.', '2004-04-23 15:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(682680, 70497, 9462, '<td valign="top">Sorry but a photo of a celeb (with numerous other cameras in the shot) is NOT serendipity. Now if he was at your doorstep with a box of chocolates... that would qualify.</td>', 'Sorry but a photo of a celeb (with numerous other cameras in the shot) is NOT serendipity. Now if he was at your doorstep with a box of chocolates... that would qualify.', '2004-04-23 15:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(682682, 71045, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nicely setup and captured.</td>', 'Nicely setup and captured.', '2004-04-23 15:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(682683, 71272, 9462, '<td valign="top">Uh huh... and not the only thing worth finding.</td>', 'Uh huh... and not the only thing worth finding.', '2004-04-23 15:44:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(682684, 71215, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great tones and you captured a good expression.</td>', 'Great tones and you captured a good expression.', '2004-04-23 15:44:19.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(682685, 71313, 5792, '<td valign="top">Godd color and use of DOF</td>', 'Godd color and use of DOF', '2004-04-23 15:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(682686, 71333, 9462, '<td valign="top">No...  think of something more interesting for challenge submissions.</td>', 'No...  think of something more interesting for challenge submissions.', '2004-04-23 15:45:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(682695, 71265, 15642, '<td valign="top">Which Beatle is that? Paul or Ringo?</td>', 'Which Beatle is that? Paul or Ringo?', '2004-04-23 15:57:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(682696, 70459, 16318, '<td valign="top">it would be perfect had it been 1 four leaf clover instead of 2 looking like one.</td>', 'it would be perfect had it been 1 four leaf clover instead of 2 looking like one.', '2004-04-23 16:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(682699, 70242, 5792, '<td valign="top">Subject and DOF are all fine with this image. Framing is particularly good. Noise reduction and color adjustments would have improved this image dramatically. Digital haloing, particularly on the stem, is a distraction. Looks like it may have been oversharpened.</td>', 'Subject and DOF are all fine with this image. Framing is particularly good. Noise reduction and color adjustments would have improved this image dramatically. Digital haloing, particularly on the stem, is a distraction. Looks like it may have been oversharpened.', '2004-04-23 16:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(682704, 71261, 9668, '<td valign="top">Cool water shot, nice texture. Not quite sure how it is a serendipity</td>', 'Cool water shot, nice texture. Not quite sure how it is a serendipity', '2004-04-23 16:08:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(682705, 70954, 5792, '<td valign="top">An interesting concept. This building is a good subject for photography.  Colors and overall technical quality of this image is not as good as it should be and that hurts it. he wires, though you can do nothing about them, are a distraction.</td>', 'An interesting concept. This building is a good subject for photography.  Colors and overall technical quality of this image is not as good as it should be and that hurts it. he wires, though you can do nothing about them, are a distraction.', '2004-04-23 16:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(682713, 71327, 9668, '<td valign="top">Great subject, the true hope. Nice shot, good color.</td>', 'Great subject, the true hope. Nice shot, good color.', '2004-04-23 16:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(682714, 70653, 5792, '<td valign="top">A very nice image with good DOF that is framed well. Some increase in brightness and contrast coupled with 10-15 percent saturation of reds to bring out the ladybug more and more cyan followed by applying some noise reduction and a touch of unsharp mask would give the image better color and much more visual impact.</td>', 'A very nice image with good DOF that is framed well. Some increase in brightness and contrast coupled with 10-15 percent saturation of reds to bring out the ladybug more and more cyan followed by applying some noise reduction and a touch of unsharp mask would give the image better color and much more visual impact.', '2004-04-23 16:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(682715, 70497, 19780, '<td valign="top">This is a very fun shot. I love how everyone in the background is also taking a photo (of his back - or maybe of you). I wish the mike wasn''t in such an awkward position, as it draws focus from your subject.</td>', 'This is a very fun shot. I love how everyone in the background is also taking a photo (of his back - or maybe of you). I wish the mike wasn''t in such an awkward position, as it draws focus from your subject.', '2004-04-23 16:25:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(682717, 70584, 18677, '<td valign="top">nice colors, looks a little oversharpened</td>', 'nice colors, looks a little oversharpened', '2004-04-23 16:30:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(682718, 70535, 18677, '<td valign="top">very nice picture, would get a higher score in a different challenge</td>', 'very nice picture, would get a higher score in a different challenge', '2004-04-23 16:31:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(682720, 70321, 18677, '<td valign="top">looks way too oversharpened</td>', 'looks way too oversharpened', '2004-04-23 16:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(682722, 71294, 9668, '<td valign="top">To me this is a stretch. The luck of what? I''m missing something, sorry. The background clutter is distracting. Lighting could be better. I like the motion of the cat</td>', 'To me this is a stretch. The luck of what? I''m missing something, sorry. The background clutter is distracting. Lighting could be better. I like the motion of the cat', '2004-04-23 16:33:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(682725, 70584, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and stark lighting (they''re malted easter eggs, right?). The choice of the gem is interesting too, since it''s of similar size and texture. Certainly not a welcome find if it ends up in your mouth though! A very fun interpretation of the assignment and one of the best "staged" ones in my opinion.</td>', 'I like the colors and stark lighting (they''re malted easter eggs, right?). The choice of the gem is interesting too, since it''s of similar size and texture. Certainly not a welcome find if it ends up in your mouth though! A very fun interpretation of the assignment and one of the best "staged" ones in my opinion.', '2004-04-23 16:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(682726, 71283, 5792, '<td valign="top">You have a very dramatic sky in this image. It completely overwhelms the foreground tree silhouettes. Getting closer to just one or two of the trees and allowing them just a little more prominent position in the frame might help. Their position in the frame would make all the difference in the world. You don''t want to hide much of that beautiful sky. You want your silhouettes to become more a part of it. A little color adjustment of reds and yellows could make the sky even more dramatic.</td>', 'You have a very dramatic sky in this image. It completely overwhelms the foreground tree silhouettes. Getting closer to just one or two of the trees and allowing them just a little more prominent position in the frame might help. Their position in the frame would make all the difference in the world. You don''t want to hide much of that beautiful sky. You want your silhouettes to become more a part of it. A little color adjustment of reds and yellows could make the sky even more dramatic.', '2004-04-23 16:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(682729, 71187, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like the colors (what great soil you have!) - the color of the flowers, the trowel and the coins. The mixure of textures is also nice, the softness of the leaves, the matte finish of the flowerpot and the shininess of the coins. I would have prefered a slightly closer cropping and more detail on the coins, perhaps burying some of them more in the dirt and some more dirty (they would be if they were in the ground.)</td>', 'I like the colors (what great soil you have!) - the color of the flowers, the trowel and the coins. The mixure of textures is also nice, the softness of the leaves, the matte finish of the flowerpot and the shininess of the coins. I would have prefered a slightly closer cropping and more detail on the coins, perhaps burying some of them more in the dirt and some more dirty (they would be if they were in the ground.)', '2004-04-23 16:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(682731, 70608, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice framing and use of the rule of thirds. The image needs better focus on the turtle which is the main subject. It appears to be focused more on the turtle''s water reflection in front of it rather than the turtle itself.</td>', 'Nice framing and use of the rule of thirds. The image needs better focus on the turtle which is the main subject. It appears to be focused more on the turtle''s water reflection in front of it rather than the turtle itself.', '2004-04-23 16:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(682732, 71202, 18677, '<td valign="top">very nice picture but doesn''t fit the challenge very well.  because of orographic lifting such clouds are probably very common around these hills</td>', 'very nice picture but doesn''t fit the challenge very well.  because of orographic lifting such clouds are probably very common around these hills', '2004-04-23 16:38:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(682735, 70494, 18677, '<td valign="top">excellent lighting and focus, but not believable</td>', 'excellent lighting and focus, but not believable', '2004-04-23 16:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(682736, 70563, 5792, '<td valign="top">Framing of this image is fine but both color and grain makes it very harsh. The two dots, which are your main subjects, might be insects but it is very difficult to tell because of their size and relative poor focus.</td>', 'Framing of this image is fine but both color and grain makes it very harsh. The two dots, which are your main subjects, might be insects but it is very difficult to tell because of their size and relative poor focus.', '2004-04-23 16:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(682737, 71326, 18677, '<td valign="top">looks oversaturated and slightly out of focus</td>', 'looks oversaturated and slightly out of focus', '2004-04-23 16:45:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(682740, 71269, 18677, '<td valign="top">very unexpected, but i''ve never heard of anyone finding a penny in an apple or being happy about finding a penny in an apple</td>', 'very unexpected, but i''ve never heard of anyone finding a penny in an apple or being happy about finding a penny in an apple', '2004-04-23 16:47:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(682741, 70576, 19780, '<td valign="top">I like this take on serendipity and the sparse nature of your composition. I would probably shift it a little bit to the right so that the ring was more in the lower right side of the frame, but I like the texture of the acorn.</td>', 'I like this take on serendipity and the sparse nature of your composition. I would probably shift it a little bit to the right so that the ring was more in the lower right side of the frame, but I like the texture of the acorn.', '2004-04-23 16:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(682743, 70438, 19780, '<td valign="top">What a fun shot. I always enjoy finding little sentences, fun names or coincidences in cemeteries. I like your choice of duotone and exposure/dof. The composition feels slightly off to me, I think I''d like to see the "getting" stone off to the left just slightly, but I recognize that there were limitations based on the fact that you didn''t place these tombstones. Fits the challenge as well.</td>', 'What a fun shot. I always enjoy finding little sentences, fun names or coincidences in cemeteries. I like your choice of duotone and exposure/dof. The composition feels slightly off to me, I think I''d like to see the "getting" stone off to the left just slightly, but I recognize that there were limitations based on the fact that you didn''t place these tombstones. Fits the challenge as well.', '2004-04-23 16:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(682744, 70535, 19780, '<td valign="top">The detail on the head is delightful, I''m glad that you got a little of his shoulders too. I wish the shot was framed to show the architecture of the bridge a little to highlight the incongruity of the nesting bird on a man-made construction. Lovely colors and good DOF.</td>', 'The detail on the head is delightful, I''m glad that you got a little of his shoulders too. I wish the shot was framed to show the architecture of the bridge a little to highlight the incongruity of the nesting bird on a man-made construction. Lovely colors and good DOF.', '2004-04-23 16:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(682750, 71208, 19780, '<td valign="top">I liked this shot quite a bit - the textures of the shells are nice, I like the placement of the one to the right of the frame. The pearls are lit well and I like the red background.</td>', 'I liked this shot quite a bit - the textures of the shells are nice, I like the placement of the one to the right of the frame. The pearls are lit well and I like the red background.', '2004-04-23 17:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(682755, 71305, 10918, '<td valign="top">How''d you do it?<br/>I like, very much. Top Ten, at least</td>', 'How''d you do it?I like, very much. Top Ten, at least', '2004-04-23 17:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(682756, 71246, 5792, '<td valign="top">Concept and framing of this image is good. This reminds me of jumping in piles of leaves when I was a kid. It is probably your camera but the overall quality of the image makes it look more like a snapshot. I don''t know where you live but judging from what I can see here it looks rural and if it is I envy you.</td>', 'Concept and framing of this image is good. This reminds me of jumping in piles of leaves when I was a kid. It is probably your camera but the overall quality of the image makes it look more like a snapshot. I don''t know where you live but judging from what I can see here it looks rural and if it is I envy you.', '2004-04-23 17:07:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(682758, 71044, 10918, '<td valign="top">Cool effect. Darkening the hand would make that part of the image less distracting. Nice Shot!<br/>(7)<br/></td>', 'Cool effect. Darkening the hand would make that part of the image less distracting. Nice Shot!(7)', '2004-04-23 17:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(682759, 71234, 10918, '<td valign="top">Very cool. How was this done?</td>', 'Very cool. How was this done?', '2004-04-23 17:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(682765, 71285, 10918, '<td valign="top">Expensive shot</td>', 'Expensive shot', '2004-04-23 17:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(682766, 70482, 5792, '<td valign="top">This is such a nice scene. This image could be improved a lot in several basic ways. First, it probably should be made level. It may have been your intention, but the amount of angle just makes it look unintentionally crooked. The daisys and the background on the upper left are badly overexposed. It appears the image is oversharpened. What might work better for this shot would be to take the picture from near ground level looking up with one or two of the daisys prominent in the frame and the statuary big in the background. Using shallow depth of field where the daisys were in sharp focus but the statuary in much softer focus in the background would make a good effect.</td>', 'This is such a nice scene. This image could be improved a lot in several basic ways. First, it probably should be made level. It may have been your intention, but the amount of angle just makes it look unintentionally crooked. The daisys and the background on the upper left are badly overexposed. It appears the image is oversharpened. What might work better for this shot would be to take the picture from near ground level looking up with one or two of the daisys prominent in the frame and the statuary big in the background. Using shallow depth of field where the daisys were in sharp focus but the statuary in much softer focus in the background would make a good effect.', '2004-04-23 17:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(682770, 70323, 9668, '<td valign="top">Nice action capture. Image seems a little small and a little dark.</td>', 'Nice action capture. Image seems a little small and a little dark.', '2004-04-23 17:18:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(682785, 70874, 4767, '<td valign="top">interesting title</td>', 'interesting title', '2004-04-23 17:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(682787, 71187, 16636, '<td valign="top">simple and effective</td>', 'simple and effective', '2004-04-23 17:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(682789, 70874, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great pose and well framed with good DOF. The eagle itself is a little soft focused for me but this is a very fine image. In photoshop - Amount: 100   Threshhold: .3 and Radius 0 would work very well to improve the focus using Unsharp Mask. I tried that to see what it would look like. I thought it improved the image and this is a really good one to start with. :) Some color adjustment with brightness and contrast gives it a little more impact, but you have to be careful not to overdo it and overexpose the area above the right eye. This could be made into a fine print.</td>', 'Great pose and well framed with good DOF. The eagle itself is a little soft focused for me but this is a very fine image. In photoshop - Amount: 100   Threshhold: .3 and Radius 0 would work very well to improve the focus using Unsharp Mask. I tried that to see what it would look like. I thought it improved the image and this is a really good one to start with. :) Some color adjustment with brightness and contrast gives it a little more impact, but you have to be careful not to overdo it and overexpose the area above the right eye. This could be made into a fine print.', '2004-04-23 17:30:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(682792, 70897, 17505, '<td valign="top">I hate the border as much as I love the photo. 8 <br/>(Would have been a 9 w/o the border)</td>', 'I hate the border as much as I love the photo. 8 (Would have been a 9 w/o the border)', '2004-04-23 17:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(682815, 71283, 19493, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Love the colours in the sky</td>', 'Great shot! Love the colours in the sky', '2004-04-23 17:54:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(682830, 70844, 14614, '<td valign="top">One of my ribbon picks this challenge - capture the carefree feeling of the pre-picnic walk (suggestions for improvement?? -- I think I''d like to see the sides cropped - the square image suffers a bit from letting my eye wonder to uninteresting parts of the image instead of down the path of the two subjects.)</td>', 'One of my ribbon picks this challenge - capture the carefree feeling of the pre-picnic walk (suggestions for improvement?? -- I think I''d like to see the sides cropped - the square image suffers a bit from letting my eye wonder to uninteresting parts of the image instead of down the path of the two subjects.)', '2004-04-23 18:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(682831, 71107, 14614, '<td valign="top">that expression!  you''ve captured the moment here.  One of my ribbon picks.  Suggestions for improvement?? - light spot a top center detracts my eye a bit from the main subject -- not sure what darkening the image would do to the raindrops??</td>', 'that expression!  you''ve captured the moment here.  One of my ribbon picks.  Suggestions for improvement?? - light spot a top center detracts my eye a bit from the main subject -- not sure what darkening the image would do to the raindrops??', '2004-04-23 18:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(682832, 71034, 19708, '<td valign="top">There is such a genuine innocence here. A kid, water and not a care in the world.<br/>Brightness &amp; Saturation are both a little down for my liking, but then again the attention should be the boy, not the foliage. Good DOF.<br/>Well Done!</td>', 'There is such a genuine innocence here. A kid, water and not a care in the world.Brightness & Saturation are both a little down for my liking, but then again the attention should be the boy, not the foliage. Good DOF.Well Done!', '2004-04-23 18:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(682833, 70535, 14614, '<td valign="top">OOO -- very nice capture, crisp subject,excellent dof.  One of my ribbon picks this challenge</td>', 'OOO -- very nice capture, crisp subject,excellent dof.  One of my ribbon picks this challenge', '2004-04-23 18:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(682834, 71193, 14614, '<td valign="top">excellent dof and expression -- one of my favorites this challenge (and I''m a bit squirrelled-out so hats off to your fine image!)</td>', 'excellent dof and expression -- one of my favorites this challenge (and I''m a bit squirrelled-out so hats off to your fine image!)', '2004-04-23 18:17:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(682835, 71149, 19708, '<td valign="top">Quite unusual.<br/>Drawn in by the stunning clouds, only to find a bird soaring.<br/>Nice!</td>', 'Quite unusual.Drawn in by the stunning clouds, only to find a bird soaring.Nice!', '2004-04-23 18:17:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(682836, 71293, 14614, '<td valign="top">lovely study in blue - one of my favorites this challenge</td>', 'lovely study in blue - one of my favorites this challenge', '2004-04-23 18:18:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(682839, 70595, 19708, '<td valign="top">Great imaging &amp; colors!  Wow!<br/>Not real sure what that is inside. Perhaps if I knew, then I could better judge it''s meaning in the challenge...<br/></td>', 'Great imaging & colors!  Wow!Not real sure what that is inside. Perhaps if I knew, then I could better judge it''s meaning in the challenge...', '2004-04-23 18:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(682840, 71164, 19708, '<td valign="top">Cute.<br/>A tad bit too staged, but it does fit. Good imaging &amp; composition, even if it is from under the bed...<br/>:)</td>', 'Cute.A tad bit too staged, but it does fit. Good imaging & composition, even if it is from under the bed...:)', '2004-04-23 18:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(682841, 70786, 16982, '<td valign="top">A very good idea, but I think you could have spent some more time on the lighting.  The dark background doesn''t seem to work well and the indistinct colour of the liquid in the foreground needs to be a bit more vivid.  I can see the "best before" stamp on the egg!</td>', 'A very good idea, but I think you could have spent some more time on the lighting.  The dark background doesn''t seem to work well and the indistinct colour of the liquid in the foreground needs to be a bit more vivid.  I can see the "best before" stamp on the egg!', '2004-04-23 18:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(682855, 71285, 16488, '<td valign="top">I like the idea.  The exposure seems rich and crisp.  Nice choice of color for the background, it contrasts well with the notes.  Wish the notes seemed to "grow" from the tree a bit more--perhaps changing the way they''re attached and varying their shapes some would help.</td>', 'I like the idea.  The exposure seems rich and crisp.  Nice choice of color for the background, it contrasts well with the notes.  Wish the notes seemed to "grow" from the tree a bit more--perhaps changing the way they''re attached and varying their shapes some would help.', '2004-04-23 18:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(682857, 71281, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Lots of diamonds in the challenge, but I like this almost-believable context.  The lighting is harsh and perhaps a little overexposed.  The composition is o.k. but I miss the paper wrapping that comes with the prize and feel the set-up of the box is just a little too unnatural.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Lots of diamonds in the challenge, but I like this almost-believable context.  The lighting is harsh and perhaps a little overexposed.  The composition is o.k. but I miss the paper wrapping that comes with the prize and feel the set-up of the box is just a little too unnatural.', '2004-04-23 18:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(682906, 70723, 20194, '<td valign="top">I love the color and the shadows in this picture.</td>', 'I love the color and the shadows in this picture.', '2004-04-23 19:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(682953, 70683, 16488, '<td valign="top">Nice stop-action photo.  I think cropping out the umpire (and the lady behind him) would have focused attention on the "moment" of the ball.</td>', 'Nice stop-action photo.  I think cropping out the umpire (and the lady behind him) would have focused attention on the "moment" of the ball.', '2004-04-23 20:28:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(682960, 71296, 16488, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of certain store signs (years ago) in the Cross County Mall in Yonkers, NY!  I like the "S" for Serendipity, helps to have that connnection in this challenge I think.</td>', 'This reminds me of certain store signs (years ago) in the Cross County Mall in Yonkers, NY!  I like the "S" for Serendipity, helps to have that connnection in this challenge I think.', '2004-04-23 20:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(682963, 71277, 16488, '<td valign="top">Maybe I''m missing something here.  The image seems to have been rotated 90 degrees to the right.  The light is interesting and the play of line and color nice.  Serendipitous?  Not sure about that.</td>', 'Maybe I''m missing something here.  The image seems to have been rotated 90 degrees to the right.  The light is interesting and the play of line and color nice.  Serendipitous?  Not sure about that.', '2004-04-23 20:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(682965, 70563, 19608, '<td valign="top">Beautiful color - nice composition.</td>', 'Beautiful color - nice composition.', '2004-04-23 20:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(682966, 71149, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very interesting clouds - nice effect.  Flying bird adds a lot - without it where would the serendipity be?  Tree silhouette effective.<br/> <br/>The bright spot being so over exposed cost you a couple points.</td>', 'Very interesting clouds - nice effect.  Flying bird adds a lot - without it where would the serendipity be?  Tree silhouette effective. The bright spot being so over exposed cost you a couple points.', '2004-04-23 20:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(682968, 71283, 19780, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors and composition with the balance of sky and clouds. I like the treeline in the frame at the bottom.</td>', 'Wonderful colors and composition with the balance of sky and clouds. I like the treeline in the frame at the bottom.', '2004-04-23 20:56:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(682969, 71328, 19780, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and contrast, I like the composition and statement as it relates to the assignment of serendipity.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and contrast, I like the composition and statement as it relates to the assignment of serendipity.', '2004-04-23 20:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(682970, 71265, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice idea - the "arrows" in the web pattern seem to be telling the visitor which way to go.  But unfortunately the backgroud being so busy and bright destroys the image photographically.  Compsitionally, I think it would have been better if the beetle was not so centered.</td>', 'Nice idea - the "arrows" in the web pattern seem to be telling the visitor which way to go.  But unfortunately the backgroud being so busy and bright destroys the image photographically.  Compsitionally, I think it would have been better if the beetle was not so centered.', '2004-04-23 21:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(682973, 70525, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great idea - cute little guy.  Unfortunately the bright and busy background destroys the image photographically.  Plus, the entire bottom half (or more) adds nothing.  So - get in closer, watch for clutter behind your subject - and keep shooting.</td>', 'Great idea - cute little guy.  Unfortunately the bright and busy background destroys the image photographically.  Plus, the entire bottom half (or more) adds nothing.  So - get in closer, watch for clutter behind your subject - and keep shooting.', '2004-04-23 21:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(682976, 70695, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Unfortunatly the image is very busy - the viewer has to really "search" to find the subject.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Unfortunatly the image is very busy - the viewer has to really "search" to find the subject.', '2004-04-23 21:04:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(682978, 70766, 19608, '<td valign="top">No - the serendipity is not to search for the needle, it is to actually FIND IT!  Cute title.  Good placement of the needle.  It''s a very busy image that doesn''t do a lot for me for impact.</td>', 'No - the serendipity is not to search for the needle, it is to actually FIND IT!  Cute title.  Good placement of the needle.  It''s a very busy image that doesn''t do a lot for me for impact.', '2004-04-23 21:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(682980, 70807, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  Given this is a still life (or should it be called a "no life?") - I feel everything in the image should be sharp.  Better lighting could have made a dramatic differece as well.</td>', 'Nice colors.  Given this is a still life (or should it be called a "no life?") - I feel everything in the image should be sharp.  Better lighting could have made a dramatic differece as well.', '2004-04-23 21:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(682984, 71262, 19608, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I just don''t see the subject of the challenge.  Nice use of monotone color.</td>', 'Sorry, I just don''t see the subject of the challenge.  Nice use of monotone color.', '2004-04-23 21:11:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(682989, 70685, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  I shot some liquid lupine yesterday myself.  It''s definitely serendipity to find those droplets.... even if you put them there.</td>', 'Very nice composition.  I shot some liquid lupine yesterday myself.  It''s definitely serendipity to find those droplets.... even if you put them there.', '2004-04-23 21:13:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(682992, 70761, 19608, '<td valign="top">The colors are very nice - working well together.  But, unfortunately the dead centering of the subject detracts a bit.  Finally, it''s a bit difficult to read, maybe a different angle would make it easier.</td>', 'The colors are very nice - working well together.  But, unfortunately the dead centering of the subject detracts a bit.  Finally, it''s a bit difficult to read, maybe a different angle would make it easier.', '2004-04-23 21:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(682995, 70347, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of shuuter speed to get the water perfect.  Model must be very skilled at not moving.  I think it would be a bit stronger if you moved in.</td>', 'Excellent use of shuuter speed to get the water perfect.  Model must be very skilled at not moving.  I think it would be a bit stronger if you moved in.', '2004-04-23 21:18:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(682996, 70521, 17580, '<td valign="top">I like the tones of this photo</td>', 'I like the tones of this photo', '2004-04-23 21:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(682998, 70635, 17580, '<td valign="top">Great subject and colors - I would slightly brighten the area on the right</td>', 'Great subject and colors - I would slightly brighten the area on the right', '2004-04-23 21:19:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(683002, 71097, 19608, '<td valign="top">Lovely image!  I suspect it''s probably "upside down" from the way you took it, but turning it this way adds the mystery.  Good thinking.</td>', 'Lovely image!  I suspect it''s probably "upside down" from the way you took it, but turning it this way adds the mystery.  Good thinking.', '2004-04-23 21:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
