(683118, 71313, 18349, '<td valign="top">Too blurry  for my taste.  I also know nothing about how to play a guitar, so I wouldn''t ever really know if this is an amazing new chord progression.  I do like the colors and the fact that at least you stepped out of the box.</td>', 'Too blurry  for my taste.  I also know nothing about how to play a guitar, so I wouldn''t ever really know if this is an amazing new chord progression.  I do like the colors and the fact that at least you stepped out of the box.', '2004-04-23 23:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(683123, 70629, 18349, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective.  I am guessing the serendipity aspect is in the fact that you were able to get this shot at all.  I won''t even ask how.  The patterns below the trails, I assume are shadows, but they are a bit distracting.  Perhaps a little PS work on the shadows would help with that.  Good submission...it''s one of few that IMHO meet the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting perspective.  I am guessing the serendipity aspect is in the fact that you were able to get this shot at all.  I won''t even ask how.  The patterns below the trails, I assume are shadows, but they are a bit distracting.  Perhaps a little PS work on the shadows would help with that.  Good submission...it''s one of few that IMHO meet the challenge.', '2004-04-23 23:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(683125, 70716, 18349, '<td valign="top">I am confused by this one, I''ll admit.  I guess in your mind it represents serendipity, but I can''t see it.  I know you have gone to great lengths to get this aprticular shot, so I won''t be cruel.  But I don''t get it as being on the challenge topic.</td>', 'I am confused by this one, I''ll admit.  I guess in your mind it represents serendipity, but I can''t see it.  I know you have gone to great lengths to get this aprticular shot, so I won''t be cruel.  But I don''t get it as being on the challenge topic.', '2004-04-23 23:18:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(683175, 71149, 19841, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract composition.  The bat (?) almost gets lost in the pattern of the clouds.  That''s partly bad, because without the bat, there isn''t much point.  It''s partly good, because it is cool how the shapes match.</td>', 'Nice abstract composition.  The bat (?) almost gets lost in the pattern of the clouds.  That''s partly bad, because without the bat, there isn''t much point.  It''s partly good, because it is cool how the shapes match.', '2004-04-24 00:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(683176, 71205, 20312, '<td valign="top">haha, i have to admit it was a clever title, however, i don''t feel as if really captures serendipity. One can imagine how it COULD be, however it''s not clearly demonstrated in the photo. Maybe with less money and not so evenly spread out, so it would seem more nateral, and staged shot. I give it a 5 (avg)</td>', 'haha, i have to admit it was a clever title, however, i don''t feel as if really captures serendipity. One can imagine how it COULD be, however it''s not clearly demonstrated in the photo. Maybe with less money and not so evenly spread out, so it would seem more nateral, and staged shot. I give it a 5 (avg)', '2004-04-24 00:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(683185, 71334, 20312, '<td valign="top">this is a nice photo, and i liked it, HOWEVER, i don''t feel as if it really captures serendipity, since no one is "making happy and unexpected discoveries. " (Going to use a double negative here but try to make sense of it.) It''s not not unexpected, like a game of chance like this would expect a person to at one point or another in the game to get a hand like this. Also, something that would be explained more would be nice. I had to get a friend who knows about texas hold''em to explain what was going on. Also, from a photography point of view, i would have liked more emphasize on the cards being turned over, and thus increasing the emphasize on the serendipity. A 6 in my book.</td>', 'this is a nice photo, and i liked it, HOWEVER, i don''t feel as if it really captures serendipity, since no one is "making happy and unexpected discoveries. " (Going to use a double negative here but try to make sense of it.) It''s not not unexpected, like a game of chance like this would expect a person to at one point or another in the game to get a hand like this. Also, something that would be explained more would be nice. I had to get a friend who knows about texas hold''em to explain what was going on. Also, from a photography point of view, i would have liked more emphasize on the cards being turned over, and thus increasing the emphasize on the serendipity. A 6 in my book.', '2004-04-24 00:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(683192, 70716, 19519, '<td valign="top">I''m not seeing serendipity here, unless maybe you thought that you have found by fortunate accident that playing with the shutter speed is fun?  Interesting, anyway!</td>', 'I''m not seeing serendipity here, unless maybe you thought that you have found by fortunate accident that playing with the shutter speed is fun?  Interesting, anyway!', '2004-04-24 00:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
