(683196, 71314, 19519, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I LOVE this photo!  A fortunate find for you, I would have to say... I like the fact that you took it at night, with the repetition in the lights.  I also like how the red and green contrast with each other throughout the photo.  Nice job!</td>', 'Very nice, I LOVE this photo!  A fortunate find for you, I would have to say... I like the fact that you took it at night, with the repetition in the lights.  I also like how the red and green contrast with each other throughout the photo.  Nice job!', '2004-04-24 00:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
