(683333, 71308, 9668, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot and fits the topic too. Amazing falls. Too bad about the odd shadow where the rainbow ends at. I love the water in the foreground. Great job.</td>', 'Beautiful shot and fits the topic too. Amazing falls. Too bad about the odd shadow where the rainbow ends at. I love the water in the foreground. Great job.', '2004-04-24 02:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(683335, 70696, 19608, '<td valign="top">The image is great!  Composition very well done.  I love the way the left side has the "extra" fence while the right side doesn''t.  This is one time where my biggest complaint with an entry is its title.  I can think of many many more appropriate titles without really trying.  Great use of black and white.</td>', 'The image is great!  Composition very well done.  I love the way the left side has the "extra" fence while the right side doesn''t.  This is one time where my biggest complaint with an entry is its title.  I can think of many many more appropriate titles without really trying.  Great use of black and white.', '2004-04-24 02:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(683338, 71000, 20214, '<td valign="top">The True meaning of this challenge! Very good!</td>', 'The True meaning of this challenge! Very good!', '2004-04-24 02:48:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(683340, 71230, 19608, '<td valign="top">One of several "golden egg" photos and perhaps the best of the bunch.  The black background is very effective as is the lighting.  I do have a problem with the feather on the left - it appears so "placed" - but don''t ask me why I think that.  Perhaps it is too perfect - I''d love to see other options.  Overall a very nice effort.</td>', 'One of several "golden egg" photos and perhaps the best of the bunch.  The black background is very effective as is the lighting.  I do have a problem with the feather on the left - it appears so "placed" - but don''t ask me why I think that.  Perhaps it is too perfect - I''d love to see other options.  Overall a very nice effort.', '2004-04-24 02:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(683341, 71246, 20214, '<td valign="top">Very good!</td>', 'Very good!', '2004-04-24 02:49:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(683343, 70521, 20214, '<td valign="top">Again, I love black and white photos!</td>', 'Again, I love black and white photos!', '2004-04-24 02:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(683344, 71198, 20214, '<td valign="top">Good color.</td>', 'Good color.', '2004-04-24 02:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(683345, 70717, 19608, '<td valign="top">Lighting is great!  Composition is perfect.  The test strip is a stretch to get the message however.</td>', 'Lighting is great!  Composition is perfect.  The test strip is a stretch to get the message however.', '2004-04-24 02:51:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(683346, 70865, 20214, '<td valign="top">Very good.</td>', 'Very good.', '2004-04-24 02:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(683347, 70347, 20214, '<td valign="top">A wider view would have been nice. Good shot!</td>', 'A wider view would have been nice. Good shot!', '2004-04-24 02:53:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(683349, 70604, 20214, '<td valign="top">Great composition!</td>', 'Great composition!', '2004-04-24 02:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
