(683848, 71083, 17580, '<td valign="top">I love this photo - it''s great.  The only thing I would change is to make the background a little less distracting - for example, remove the powerlines and cars in photoshop (which, of course, isn''t allowed in the challenge).  Other than that, this could easily be a commercial photograph.  Good job.</td>', 'I love this photo - it''s great.  The only thing I would change is to make the background a little less distracting - for example, remove the powerlines and cars in photoshop (which, of course, isn''t allowed in the challenge).  Other than that, this could easily be a commercial photograph.  Good job.', '2004-04-24 19:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
