(684050, 71210, 19608, '<td valign="top">Neat idea and execution.  Why aren''t you on a long extended vacation? :)  I''d like to see just a bit more of the pen.</td>', 'Neat idea and execution.  Why aren''t you on a long extended vacation? :)  I''d like to see just a bit more of the pen.', '2004-04-25 00:39:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(684052, 71307, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great title.  The black background is perfect for your egg colors.  Lighting very good.  My major complaint with your entry is that the feathers are way overdone.  I''d suggest removing the feathers from both back eggs and the right front, leaving only the left front and the one between the eggs.</td>', 'Great title.  The black background is perfect for your egg colors.  Lighting very good.  My major complaint with your entry is that the feathers are way overdone.  I''d suggest removing the feathers from both back eggs and the right front, leaving only the left front and the one between the eggs.', '2004-04-25 00:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(684054, 71202, 19608, '<td valign="top">Very nice scenic - the clouds are terrific.  A bit weak on the subject of serendipity.</td>', 'Very nice scenic - the clouds are terrific.  A bit weak on the subject of serendipity.', '2004-04-25 00:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(684056, 70998, 19608, '<td valign="top">Interesting reflection - rather mysterious.</td>', 'Interesting reflection - rather mysterious.', '2004-04-25 00:44:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(684059, 71108, 19608, '<td valign="top">The lion and his/her pose is marvelous.  Lighting on the paw, tail, and back (a bit hot) works very well.<br/> <br/>Unfortunately the sky area is so bright it detracts a lot.  The out of focus line on the bottom (probably the fence) is also a problem.</td>', 'The lion and his/her pose is marvelous.  Lighting on the paw, tail, and back (a bit hot) works very well. Unfortunately the sky area is so bright it detracts a lot.  The out of focus line on the bottom (probably the fence) is also a problem.', '2004-04-25 00:47:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(684068, 70314, 616, '<td valign="top">Clever. I like how the fingers seem to have a softness to them yet the photograph and the money are still sharp.</td>', 'Clever. I like how the fingers seem to have a softness to them yet the photograph and the money are still sharp.', '2004-04-25 01:12:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(684072, 70837, 616, '<td valign="top">Interseting shot. For some reason the colour here is rubbing me in the wrong way. Perhaps a black and white selection would have a greater impact. But thats just me.</td>', 'Interseting shot. For some reason the colour here is rubbing me in the wrong way. Perhaps a black and white selection would have a greater impact. But thats just me.', '2004-04-25 01:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(684074, 71082, 616, '<td valign="top">nice lighting. It gently blends in with your subject.</td>', 'nice lighting. It gently blends in with your subject.', '2004-04-25 01:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(684079, 71230, 616, '<td valign="top">very clever. The composition is very pleasing to the eye. The positioning of your subject was also a very wise choice. I think any other placing of the nest wouldn''t have been as effective.</td>', 'very clever. The composition is very pleasing to the eye. The positioning of your subject was also a very wise choice. I think any other placing of the nest wouldn''t have been as effective.', '2004-04-25 01:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(684080, 70888, 12253, '<td valign="top">I can see how this represents serendipity, because the flowers are not where they should be.  I like the way you''ve composed this as well, and the exposure is spot on.  The geometry of the sidewalk works well too.  One of my two favorites to ribbon.</td>', 'I can see how this represents serendipity, because the flowers are not where they should be.  I like the way you''ve composed this as well, and the exposure is spot on.  The geometry of the sidewalk works well too.  One of my two favorites to ribbon.', '2004-04-25 01:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(684081, 70507, 12253, '<td valign="top">I think this is great.  Good for the challenge, in tht the balloon is peeking over the corner, and a very spectacular photo.    All the elements work as they should.  Very nice work--my favorite to ribbon.</td>', 'I think this is great.  Good for the challenge, in tht the balloon is peeking over the corner, and a very spectacular photo.    All the elements work as they should.  Very nice work--my favorite to ribbon.', '2004-04-25 01:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(684082, 70608, 616, '<td valign="top">This seems a bit lackluster, but the composition is nicely done.</td>', 'This seems a bit lackluster, but the composition is nicely done.', '2004-04-25 01:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(684086, 71269, 616, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. The contrast between the red background and green apple is splendid. I find the angle of the apple also appealing.</td>', 'Nicely done. The contrast between the red background and green apple is splendid. I find the angle of the apple also appealing.', '2004-04-25 01:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(684089, 71314, 616, '<td valign="top">Nice night shot. This subect here has a lot of potential. What might have been more affective is showing the contrast between this garden and the "modern metropolis" (if possible) in a wider shot. : )</td>', 'Nice night shot. This subect here has a lot of potential. What might have been more affective is showing the contrast between this garden and the "modern metropolis" (if possible) in a wider shot. : )', '2004-04-25 01:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
