(684091, 71270, 616, '<td valign="top">Very very clever. It didn''t sink in at first. Nice choice of DOF. I dont think any other would have fit.</td>', 'Very very clever. It didn''t sink in at first. Nice choice of DOF. I dont think any other would have fit.', '2004-04-25 01:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
