(684098, 71164, 12253, '<td valign="top">A pretty good staged shot, which does communicate the challenge.  I think it would have been better to leave the candy wrapped--not a good chance find to find candy which is open and dirty and thus needs to be thrown away.  Also, I think her look should have been one of delight, not shock/surprise.</td>', 'A pretty good staged shot, which does communicate the challenge.  I think it would have been better to leave the candy wrapped--not a good chance find to find candy which is open and dirty and thus needs to be thrown away.  Also, I think her look should have been one of delight, not shock/surprise.', '2004-04-25 01:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(684101, 71332, 616, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition. The frames are a nice touch. The lighting is very interesting. It seems you have various light sources beaming from different positions.</td>', 'Very nice composition. The frames are a nice touch. The lighting is very interesting. It seems you have various light sources beaming from different positions.', '2004-04-25 01:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
