(684107, 71185, 616, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting. A different positioning of her hands+cup might have had a greater effect. It seems she''s staring in the bottom of her mug and not at someone (if thats what you were aiming for).</td>', 'Nice lighting. A different positioning of her hands+cup might have had a greater effect. It seems she''s staring in the bottom of her mug and not at someone (if thats what you were aiming for).', '2004-04-25 02:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
