(684357, 71324, 5822, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge well, but I would have liked to have seen better exposure on the boat, which seems a bit dark, and shot at a different angle (or turning the boat) so the boat''s side is in better view.</td>', 'Meets the challenge well, but I would have liked to have seen better exposure on the boat, which seems a bit dark, and shot at a different angle (or turning the boat) so the boat''s side is in better view.', '2004-04-25 13:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(684358, 70259, 8891, '<td valign="top">I''m not :)ing</td>', 'I''m not :)ing', '2004-04-25 13:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(684359, 70888, 14578, '<td valign="top">Precise application of the rule of thirds (place the objects of interest at the junction of lines dividing the frame into 3 equal parts) will give you a better composition. Crop out the small bit of flower at the left edge as well.</td>', 'Precise application of the rule of thirds (place the objects of interest at the junction of lines dividing the frame into 3 equal parts) will give you a better composition. Crop out the small bit of flower at the left edge as well.', '2004-04-25 13:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(684361, 70997, 5822, '<td valign="top">Lovely pastoral scene and I like the effect that the bright haze/mist gives. Maybe some cropping at the top of the picture is needed. Not sure how exactly this meets the challenge, but still a very nice photo.</td>', 'Lovely pastoral scene and I like the effect that the bright haze/mist gives. Maybe some cropping at the top of the picture is needed. Not sure how exactly this meets the challenge, but still a very nice photo.', '2004-04-25 13:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(684365, 71332, 5822, '<td valign="top">Lovely picture and meets the challenge well.  I really like the colors and the arrangement of the elements, but find the small chrome flowerpot and teapot in the lower right need some propping up as they appear sloping and throw the image off balance. Very well done otherwise.</td>', 'Lovely picture and meets the challenge well.  I really like the colors and the arrangement of the elements, but find the small chrome flowerpot and teapot in the lower right need some propping up as they appear sloping and throw the image off balance. Very well done otherwise.', '2004-04-25 13:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(684367, 70865, 14578, '<td valign="top">crio to a panorama &amp; you will have a fab pic</td>', 'crio to a panorama & you will have a fab pic', '2004-04-25 13:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(684373, 70874, 14578, '<td valign="top">Rule of thirds will give more impact</td>', 'Rule of thirds will give more impact', '2004-04-25 13:29:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(684375, 71239, 5822, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors with a nice spring-like feel, but I see no specific subject to focus on and the image is a bit too busy. Also, I see some noise that can be fixed up with Neat Image or Noise Ninja.</td>', 'Lovely colors with a nice spring-like feel, but I see no specific subject to focus on and the image is a bit too busy. Also, I see some noise that can be fixed up with Neat Image or Noise Ninja.', '2004-04-25 13:30:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(684379, 70323, 14578, '<td valign="top">Crop to make the shore line divide the image into equal halfs. The surfer, board &amp; the curving water spray is placed precisely at the shore line interface will make the image beautifully balanced. The surf spray at the bottom distracts</td>', 'Crop to make the shore line divide the image into equal halfs. The surfer, board & the curving water spray is placed precisely at the shore line interface will make the image beautifully balanced. The surf spray at the bottom distracts', '2004-04-25 13:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
