(684398, 71203, 5822, '<td valign="top">Lovely combination of colors and great DOF. Focus on the bird is good, but appears a bit dark around the eyes.</td>', 'Lovely combination of colors and great DOF. Focus on the bird is good, but appears a bit dark around the eyes.', '2004-04-25 13:51:46.000000', NULL, 1),
