(685469, 70563, 5822, '<td valign="top">I like the colors and grainy quality of the flower petals, as well as, the composition, which is really very good. For me, the weakest part of the picture is your subject, the two jewels, which seem under lit. They need a bit more pop from say a spot light, albeit hard to do with such small subjects. Actually, I think the whole image could use more light.  Looks like your light source was natural light from a window? Good job, nonetheless. 8</td>', 'I like the colors and grainy quality of the flower petals, as well as, the composition, which is really very good. For me, the weakest part of the picture is your subject, the two jewels, which seem under lit. They need a bit more pop from say a spot light, albeit hard to do with such small subjects. Actually, I think the whole image could use more light.  Looks like your light source was natural light from a window? Good job, nonetheless. 8', '2004-04-26 08:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(685473, 71333, 5822, '<td valign="top">The idea is a good one and meets the challenge well but I believe your lighting is not well controlled.  For one thing, the dollar bills are dark from shadows from lighting that is not well positioned.  Also, the lighting is creating back lighting on the pages on the left side showing through the back side of the pages.   I may not have used a book with illustrations or pictures as this detracts from the impact of your subject, which is already weakened by poor lighting.  Finally, cropping at the top seems constrained.</td>', 'The idea is a good one and meets the challenge well but I believe your lighting is not well controlled.  For one thing, the dollar bills are dark from shadows from lighting that is not well positioned.  Also, the lighting is creating back lighting on the pages on the left side showing through the back side of the pages.   I may not have used a book with illustrations or pictures as this detracts from the impact of your subject, which is already weakened by poor lighting.  Finally, cropping at the top seems constrained.', '2004-04-26 08:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(685477, 70482, 5822, '<td valign="top">The scene has a lot of appeal and potential but is weakened by a blown out sky that detracts from your main subject and by a tilted horizon line.</td>', 'The scene has a lot of appeal and potential but is weakened by a blown out sky that detracts from your main subject and by a tilted horizon line.', '2004-04-26 08:41:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(685484, 70346, 5822, '<td valign="top">It''s good you used B&amp;W book to contrast with the colored bill, but I find the illustration in the book competes for attention with the bill.</td>', 'It''s good you used B&W book to contrast with the colored bill, but I find the illustration in the book competes for attention with the bill.', '2004-04-26 08:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
