(685756, 71184, 18389, '<td valign="top">Lovely and crisp.  The shadows under the eye and cheek are perhaps a bit deep.</td>', 'Lovely and crisp.  The shadows under the eye and cheek are perhaps a bit deep.', '2004-04-26 12:54:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(685764, 71184, 15919, '<td valign="top">Not sure if I get the idea.  The image it self is fine, sharp and detaled.  Maybe it´s a bit overcontrasted and I think the bright spots on the chin and the nose and bye the moth may be a litle distracting.  Thoug the image it self has this brown sepia color I think the frame should have been black.</td>', 'Not sure if I get the idea.  The image it self is fine, sharp and detaled.  Maybe it´s a bit overcontrasted and I think the bright spots on the chin and the nose and bye the moth may be a litle distracting.  Thoug the image it self has this brown sepia color I think the frame should have been black.', '2004-04-26 13:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(685769, 70816, 15919, '<td valign="top">Good angel and I like the lines.  Not sure if I get the idea.  It doesn´t seem very sharp, maybe you should have used a tighter apperture if you could.  The color of the sky also seem litle strange, litle to greenish for my opinion.  Dont know what your equipements are but a polarizing filter would probably have come in hand there.</td>', 'Good angel and I like the lines.  Not sure if I get the idea.  It doesn´t seem very sharp, maybe you should have used a tighter apperture if you could.  The color of the sky also seem litle strange, litle to greenish for my opinion.  Dont know what your equipements are but a polarizing filter would probably have come in hand there.', '2004-04-26 13:04:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(685791, 70665, 20679, '<td valign="top">would like to see more punch, but I like this a lot</td>', 'would like to see more punch, but I like this a lot', '2004-04-26 13:14:21.000000', NULL, 1),
