(686129, 71293, 13035, '<td valign="top">My choice for best of show.  Normally I would not like such a strong verticle component such as the tree stump placed so far to the left.  However ot work quite nicely here with both of the birds gazing intently to whatever is out there.</td>', 'My choice for best of show.  Normally I would not like such a strong verticle component such as the tree stump placed so far to the left.  However ot work quite nicely here with both of the birds gazing intently to whatever is out there.', '2004-04-26 16:19:20.000000', NULL, 1),
