(686137, 70722, 13035, '<td valign="top">On of the best in show.  I''m pulling for you to win a ribbon.  There is no chance that I would not stop to sit for a while on this bench.  An unfortunate shaddow behind the bench.  Very nice. 9</td>', 'On of the best in show.  I''m pulling for you to win a ribbon.  There is no chance that I would not stop to sit for a while on this bench.  An unfortunate shaddow behind the bench.  Very nice. 9', '2004-04-26 16:28:48.000000', NULL, 1),
