(686957, 70535, 5965, '<td valign="top">Serendipity is a difficult concept to visualize. For me it means being at the right place, at the right time, and being lucky enough to capture something unique. Some of these entries are set up shots trying to illustrate that concept, and some record a serendipitous moment experienced by the photographer themselves. This is a good example of the latter. Birds aren''t known for sitting still for portraits, so you know this image was a lucky shot. And the color sheme and composition are very pleasing.</td>', 'Serendipity is a difficult concept to visualize. For me it means being at the right place, at the right time, and being lucky enough to capture something unique. Some of these entries are set up shots trying to illustrate that concept, and some record a serendipitous moment experienced by the photographer themselves. This is a good example of the latter. Birds aren''t known for sitting still for portraits, so you know this image was a lucky shot. And the color sheme and composition are very pleasing.', '2004-04-27 04:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
