(686962, 70629, 5965, '<td valign="top">Serendipity is a difficult concept to visualize. For me it means being at the right place, at the right time, and being lucky enough to capture something unique. Some of these entries are set up shots trying to illustrate that concept, and some record a serendipitous moment experienced by the photographer themselves. If this is a set up shot, then you have way too much time on your hands. I think this is an excellent expample of being in the right place at the right time to get a great shot out of it. Great image that''s a great example of serendipity.</td>', 'Serendipity is a difficult concept to visualize. For me it means being at the right place, at the right time, and being lucky enough to capture something unique. Some of these entries are set up shots trying to illustrate that concept, and some record a serendipitous moment experienced by the photographer themselves. If this is a set up shot, then you have way too much time on your hands. I think this is an excellent expample of being in the right place at the right time to get a great shot out of it. Great image that''s a great example of serendipity.', '2004-04-27 04:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(686963, 70769, 5965, '<td valign="top">Serendipity is a difficult concept to visualize. For me it means being at the right place, at the right time, and being lucky enough to capture something unique. Some of these entries are set up shots trying to illustrate that concept, and some record a serendipitous moment experienced by the photographer themselves. This is a lovely sunset shot, but not unique enough to qualify for serendipity.</td>', 'Serendipity is a difficult concept to visualize. For me it means being at the right place, at the right time, and being lucky enough to capture something unique. Some of these entries are set up shots trying to illustrate that concept, and some record a serendipitous moment experienced by the photographer themselves. This is a lovely sunset shot, but not unique enough to qualify for serendipity.', '2004-04-27 04:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(686965, 70687, 5965, '<td valign="top">Serendipity is a difficult concept to visualize. For me it means being at the right place, at the right time, and being lucky enough to capture something unique. Some of these entries are set up shots trying to illustrate that concept, and some record a serendipitous moment experienced by the photographer themselves. This is (hopefully) a set-up shot, but it doesn''t represent serendipity, which should be a pleasant surprise. A blood-spattered young man may be a surprise, but not a serendipitous one.</td>', 'Serendipity is a difficult concept to visualize. For me it means being at the right place, at the right time, and being lucky enough to capture something unique. Some of these entries are set up shots trying to illustrate that concept, and some record a serendipitous moment experienced by the photographer themselves. This is (hopefully) a set-up shot, but it doesn''t represent serendipity, which should be a pleasant surprise. A blood-spattered young man may be a surprise, but not a serendipitous one.', '2004-04-27 04:51:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(686969, 70786, 5965, '<td valign="top">Serendipity is a difficult concept to visualize. For me it means being at the right place, at the right time, and being lucky enough to capture something unique. Some of these entries are set up shots trying to illustrate that concept, and some record a serendipitous moment experienced by the photographer themselves. This is an example of the former. I think the a flash, or bright lighting, and the resulting contrast is distracting.</td>', 'Serendipity is a difficult concept to visualize. For me it means being at the right place, at the right time, and being lucky enough to capture something unique. Some of these entries are set up shots trying to illustrate that concept, and some record a serendipitous moment experienced by the photographer themselves. This is an example of the former. I think the a flash, or bright lighting, and the resulting contrast is distracting.', '2004-04-27 04:56:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(686973, 70645, 5965, '<td valign="top">Serendipity is a difficult concept to visualize. For me it means being at the right place, at the right time, and being lucky enough to capture something unique. Some of these entries are set up shots trying to illustrate that concept, and some record a serendipitous moment experienced by the photographer themselves. This is obviously an example of the former. Nicely photographed and composed, and a cute take on the concept. Something less obvious on the message would have been better I think.  Maybe a hand-written phone number with the words "call me", or some other more mysterious message would have been more better.</td>', 'Serendipity is a difficult concept to visualize. For me it means being at the right place, at the right time, and being lucky enough to capture something unique. Some of these entries are set up shots trying to illustrate that concept, and some record a serendipitous moment experienced by the photographer themselves. This is obviously an example of the former. Nicely photographed and composed, and a cute take on the concept. Something less obvious on the message would have been better I think.  Maybe a hand-written phone number with the words "call me", or some other more mysterious message would have been more better.', '2004-04-27 04:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(686979, 70897, 5965, '<td valign="top">Serendipity is a difficult concept to visualize. For me it means being at the right place, at the right time, and being lucky enough to capture something unique. Some of these entries are set up shots trying to illustrate that concept, and some record a serendipitous moment experienced by the photographer themselves. This is a good example of the latter. This certainly feels like a serendipitious moment. The photo itself is great, however the frame is unneccessary and distracting</td>', 'Serendipity is a difficult concept to visualize. For me it means being at the right place, at the right time, and being lucky enough to capture something unique. Some of these entries are set up shots trying to illustrate that concept, and some record a serendipitous moment experienced by the photographer themselves. This is a good example of the latter. This certainly feels like a serendipitious moment. The photo itself is great, however the frame is unneccessary and distracting', '2004-04-27 05:06:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(686981, 71317, 5965, '<td valign="top">Serendipity is a difficult concept to visualize. For me it means being at the right place, at the right time, and being lucky enough to capture something unique. Some of these entries are set up shots trying to illustrate that concept, and some record a serendipitous moment experienced by the photographer themselves. This is an example of the latter. Decent enough shot, but nothing really exceptional. Doesn''t really say serendipity to me.</td>', 'Serendipity is a difficult concept to visualize. For me it means being at the right place, at the right time, and being lucky enough to capture something unique. Some of these entries are set up shots trying to illustrate that concept, and some record a serendipitous moment experienced by the photographer themselves. This is an example of the latter. Decent enough shot, but nothing really exceptional. Doesn''t really say serendipity to me.', '2004-04-27 05:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(686982, 71294, 5965, '<td valign="top">Serendipity is a difficult concept to visualize. For me it means being at the right place, at the right time, and being lucky enough to capture something unique. Some of these entries are set up shots trying to illustrate that concept, and some record a serendipitous moment experienced by the photographer themselves. Not sure which this really falls under. Nice moment captured. Is it illustrative of serendipity though.</td>', 'Serendipity is a difficult concept to visualize. For me it means being at the right place, at the right time, and being lucky enough to capture something unique. Some of these entries are set up shots trying to illustrate that concept, and some record a serendipitous moment experienced by the photographer themselves. Not sure which this really falls under. Nice moment captured. Is it illustrative of serendipity though.', '2004-04-27 05:08:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(686984, 70716, 5965, '<td valign="top">Serendipity is a difficult concept to visualize. For me it means being at the right place, at the right time, and being lucky enough to capture something unique. Some of these entries are set up shots trying to illustrate that concept, and some record a serendipitous moment experienced by the photographer themselves. This is more of a set up shot, and not really illustrative of serendipity.</td>', 'Serendipity is a difficult concept to visualize. For me it means being at the right place, at the right time, and being lucky enough to capture something unique. Some of these entries are set up shots trying to illustrate that concept, and some record a serendipitous moment experienced by the photographer themselves. This is more of a set up shot, and not really illustrative of serendipity.', '2004-04-27 05:09:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(686987, 70612, 5965, '<td valign="top">Serendipity is a difficult concept to visualize. For me it means being at the right place, at the right time, and being lucky enough to capture something unique. Some of these entries are set up shots trying to illustrate that concept, and some record a serendipitous moment experienced by the photographer themselves. This being an example of the latter. Unless of course you have a pet rabbit posing. It doesn''t feel like a very serendipitous moment. If somehow you could show the rabbit in an environment that you wouldn''t normally find it in, that would be a better illustration of the subject.</td>', 'Serendipity is a difficult concept to visualize. For me it means being at the right place, at the right time, and being lucky enough to capture something unique. Some of these entries are set up shots trying to illustrate that concept, and some record a serendipitous moment experienced by the photographer themselves. This being an example of the latter. Unless of course you have a pet rabbit posing. It doesn''t feel like a very serendipitous moment. If somehow you could show the rabbit in an environment that you wouldn''t normally find it in, that would be a better illustration of the subject.', '2004-04-27 05:11:42.000000', NULL, 1),
