(687335, 70685, 20679, '<td valign="top">This is just wonderful; the DOF, the off center main focus and the muted colors that accentuate the water drop create a compelling image.</td>', 'This is just wonderful; the DOF, the off center main focus and the muted colors that accentuate the water drop create a compelling image.', '2004-04-27 12:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(687336, 70943, 20539, '<td valign="top">well thought of.</td>', 'well thought of.', '2004-04-27 12:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(687337, 71303, 5822, '<td valign="top">Contrast range is set a bit too high as you have some blocking of shadows and hot spots in the highlights of the left.  Meets the challenge well.</td>', 'Contrast range is set a bit too high as you have some blocking of shadows and hot spots in the highlights of the left.  Meets the challenge well.', '2004-04-27 12:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(687338, 70716, 20539, '<td valign="top">out of context</td>', 'out of context', '2004-04-27 12:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(687340, 70535, 20679, '<td valign="top">Very nicely captured!</td>', 'Very nicely captured!', '2004-04-27 12:34:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(687342, 71204, 20679, '<td valign="top">an extraordinary lesson for us all in managing depth of field. Beautiful!</td>', 'an extraordinary lesson for us all in managing depth of field. Beautiful!', '2004-04-27 12:35:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(687347, 71318, 20539, '<td valign="top">hehehe</td>', 'hehehe', '2004-04-27 12:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(687352, 71185, 7322, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand how this image represents the idea of Serendipity. Sorry, it doesn''t work for me.</td>', 'I don''t understand how this image represents the idea of Serendipity. Sorry, it doesn''t work for me.', '2004-04-27 12:40:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(687373, 71308, 7322, '<td valign="top">Taking on faith it wasn''t manipulated, this photo represents Serendipity perfectly. The photo itself is pretty and rather interesting but doesn''t quite gel completely for me.</td>', 'Taking on faith it wasn''t manipulated, this photo represents Serendipity perfectly. The photo itself is pretty and rather interesting but doesn''t quite gel completely for me.', '2004-04-27 12:46:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(687377, 71254, 7322, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t cut it. It lacks imagination and it does not truly capture a serendipidous moment.</td>', 'This doesn''t cut it. It lacks imagination and it does not truly capture a serendipidous moment.', '2004-04-27 12:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(687385, 71164, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what''s going on here. My initial response was, "Huh?". Once I understood the idea that she is looking under the bed for a book (I think) and has found an old box of candy my next thought was it is so obviously staged that it just doesn''t count. By my way of thinking, one can''t stage a serendipidous event. This is a very dishonest photo.</td>', 'I''m not sure what''s going on here. My initial response was, "Huh?". Once I understood the idea that she is looking under the bed for a book (I think) and has found an old box of candy my next thought was it is so obviously staged that it just doesn''t count. By my way of thinking, one can''t stage a serendipidous event. This is a very dishonest photo.', '2004-04-27 12:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(687401, 70574, 7322, '<td valign="top">Maybe I''m misunderstanding this challenge but here is another obviously staged photo. Yes, it represents an idea, I guess but as a photo standing on its own the message is pretty obtuse. As for the technical merit of the photo, it is a nice close-up of a penny but I don''t see much in the way of composition. It''s boring.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-04-28 01:49:26.</i></td>', 'Maybe I''m misunderstanding this challenge but here is another obviously staged photo. Yes, it represents an idea, I guess but as a photo standing on its own the message is pretty obtuse. As for the technical merit of the photo, it is a nice close-up of a penny but I don''t see much in the way of composition. It''s boring.', '2004-04-27 12:54:47.000000', '2004-04-28 02:49:26.000000', 1),
(687409, 71232, 7322, '<td valign="top">I get the idea the photographer was trying to represent. One definitely finds plenty of serendipitous moments at a flea market. However, this boring shot isn''t one of them. All I see is three guys talking over a box of bags. There isn''t much to their expressions to indicate that anything delightful is taking place.  The composition is distracting. My eye keeps wandering to the guy''s butt in the background and that white blur at the corner.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-04-28 01:36:26.</i></td>', 'I get the idea the photographer was trying to represent. One definitely finds plenty of serendipitous moments at a flea market. However, this boring shot isn''t one of them. All I see is three guys talking over a box of bags. There isn''t much to their expressions to indicate that anything delightful is taking place.  The composition is distracting. My eye keeps wandering to the guy''s butt in the background and that white blur at the corner.', '2004-04-27 12:57:36.000000', '2004-04-28 02:36:26.000000', 1),
(687416, 71316, 7322, '<td valign="top">This photo had possibilities but there is not enough contrast in terms of value. I like the strong shadows their wings have created but the photo is too monochromatic to be really striking.</td>', 'This photo had possibilities but there is not enough contrast in terms of value. I like the strong shadows their wings have created but the photo is too monochromatic to be really striking.', '2004-04-27 12:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(687428, 70961, 7322, '<td valign="top">Another obviously staged moment. If I came across this photograph with no heading, and no theme in mind, I would still know it was staged. The composition might have been interesting if the subject was wearing more brightly colored pants.</td>', 'Another obviously staged moment. If I came across this photograph with no heading, and no theme in mind, I would still know it was staged. The composition might have been interesting if the subject was wearing more brightly colored pants.', '2004-04-27 13:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(687431, 71215, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a nice, casual portrait but I don''t understand how it represents serendipity. High marks for the overall image, low marks for nailing the theme.</td>', 'This is a nice, casual portrait but I don''t understand how it represents serendipity. High marks for the overall image, low marks for nailing the theme.', '2004-04-27 13:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(687433, 70604, 7322, '<td valign="top">This works for me. It was represents a serendipitous event n history and the photographer has used an unusual view point to make a humorous statement.</td>', 'This works for me. It was represents a serendipitous event n history and the photographer has used an unusual view point to make a humorous statement.', '2004-04-27 13:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(687436, 70954, 7322, '<td valign="top">The photographer pays attention to their surroundings and it shows. They took advantage of a serendipitous arrangement of letters on a sign to make a funny, new statement. Not an outstanding composition but given the limitations it works on a certain level.</td>', 'The photographer pays attention to their surroundings and it shows. They took advantage of a serendipitous arrangement of letters on a sign to make a funny, new statement. Not an outstanding composition but given the limitations it works on a certain level.', '2004-04-27 13:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(687441, 71284, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a nice composition and it represents the theme of serendipity. I like the soft muted purples and greens in the background in contrast to the rough, grey texture of the squirrel''s fur and the tree bark.</td>', 'This is a nice composition and it represents the theme of serendipity. I like the soft muted purples and greens in the background in contrast to the rough, grey texture of the squirrel''s fur and the tree bark.', '2004-04-27 13:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(687443, 71114, 7322, '<td valign="top">It''s too bad the image is faded and lacking focus because it might have worked. As it is, there isn''t enough surprise in seeing a horse''s tongue sticking out to overcome the technical problems.</td>', 'It''s too bad the image is faded and lacking focus because it might have worked. As it is, there isn''t enough surprise in seeing a horse''s tongue sticking out to overcome the technical problems.', '2004-04-27 13:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(687444, 70790, 7322, '<td valign="top">Obviously staged so uninteresting as a statement about serendipity.It''s not a striking composition. Also, I''m distracted by the other item in the pocket. Is it a can of Skoal? A cookie?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-04-28 01:44:12.</i></td>', 'Obviously staged so uninteresting as a statement about serendipity.It''s not a striking composition. Also, I''m distracted by the other item in the pocket. Is it a can of Skoal? A cookie?', '2004-04-27 13:17:18.000000', '2004-04-28 02:44:12.000000', 1),
(687446, 71300, 20785, '<td valign="top">I acutally found one of these in my uncle''s penny jar when I was a kid - the best kind, a 1909S VDB</td>', 'I acutally found one of these in my uncle''s penny jar when I was a kid - the best kind, a 1909S VDB', '2004-04-27 13:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(687447, 71317, 7322, '<td valign="top">The photographer captured a nice moment but the washed out colors and lack of focus detract from the impact reducing this to a rather dull snapshot.</td>', 'The photographer captured a nice moment but the washed out colors and lack of focus detract from the impact reducing this to a rather dull snapshot.', '2004-04-27 13:19:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(687454, 70422, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is not an uncommon sight so I don''t see a relation to the theme. The image quality is quite poor--the colors are washed out and the figures of the two boys are unfocused. Because of this, the boys looking on in the background distract from the main subject. The framing is a little off-kilter. This may have worked if the subject was in tighter focus and the background was blurred.</td>', 'This is not an uncommon sight so I don''t see a relation to the theme. The image quality is quite poor--the colors are washed out and the figures of the two boys are unfocused. Because of this, the boys looking on in the background distract from the main subject. The framing is a little off-kilter. This may have worked if the subject was in tighter focus and the background was blurred.', '2004-04-27 13:26:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(687458, 71110, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is too staged to work as a serendipitous moment. It doesn''t work on its own as a good compositon.Perhaps if the cereal box was more prominent and if the cereal was spilling out with the necklace. As it is, it looks like someone has just dumped a necklace out of a rolled up magazine onto a bowl of cereal.</td>', 'This is too staged to work as a serendipitous moment. It doesn''t work on its own as a good compositon.Perhaps if the cereal box was more prominent and if the cereal was spilling out with the necklace. As it is, it looks like someone has just dumped a necklace out of a rolled up magazine onto a bowl of cereal.', '2004-04-27 13:30:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(687463, 70786, 7322, '<td valign="top">While this is a staged moment, it is so well done I can''t argue with it. This is because the idea is clever and imaginative and the composition works. My only complaint is I would have liked to have seen the yellow of the yolk more clearly. Perhaps if the composition had been arranged on a lighter background?</td>', 'While this is a staged moment, it is so well done I can''t argue with it. This is because the idea is clever and imaginative and the composition works. My only complaint is I would have liked to have seen the yellow of the yolk more clearly. Perhaps if the composition had been arranged on a lighter background?', '2004-04-27 13:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(687468, 70766, 7322, '<td valign="top">It took me awhile to find the needle because it isn''t in as sharp focus as the straw at the top of the image. When I did it didn''t feel like much of a surprise since this was an obviously staged photograph. As a composition this photograph does not work for me. In order for the abstract quality of the straw to be really striking, the whole composition needs to be tightly focused. There is too much blurring in the foreground.</td>', 'It took me awhile to find the needle because it isn''t in as sharp focus as the straw at the top of the image. When I did it didn''t feel like much of a surprise since this was an obviously staged photograph. As a composition this photograph does not work for me. In order for the abstract quality of the straw to be really striking, the whole composition needs to be tightly focused. There is too much blurring in the foreground.', '2004-04-27 13:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(687474, 70897, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely image and honestly represents the theme of serendipity. The subject is tightly focused and the composition is good. You can see the tension in the drop of water as it is just about to drop off the stem. The slight bluring of the bug''s antenna works because the rest of the bug is sharply focused. it gives the impression that they are quivering.</td>', 'This is a lovely image and honestly represents the theme of serendipity. The subject is tightly focused and the composition is good. You can see the tension in the drop of water as it is just about to drop off the stem. The slight bluring of the bug''s antenna works because the rest of the bug is sharply focused. it gives the impression that they are quivering.', '2004-04-27 13:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(687475, 70825, 7322, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand how this bridge represents the theme of serendipity. As a composition it may have worked if the overall image were in sharper focus. As it is, the colors and textures, particulary of the wood, look washed out and bland.<br/> <br/>Comment added later: I don''t know if there was something going on with my monitor this afternoon but I swear the colors looked different to me when I voted and commented on this. Looking at it again, I would have to agree with the comments that it is oversaturated in color. I stick by my comment that it lacks textural detail in the wood. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-04-28 01:54:15.</i></td>', 'I don''t understand how this bridge represents the theme of serendipity. As a composition it may have worked if the overall image were in sharper focus. As it is, the colors and textures, particulary of the wood, look washed out and bland. Comment added later: I don''t know if there was something going on with my monitor this afternoon but I swear the colors looked different to me when I voted and commented on this. Looking at it again, I would have to agree with the comments that it is oversaturated in color. I stick by my comment that it lacks textural detail in the wood. ', '2004-04-27 13:45:54.000000', '2004-04-28 02:54:15.000000', 1),
(687478, 71272, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is the third staged photograph  I''ve come across involoving an unlikely (i.e. unbelievable) discovery of cash. My problem with these staged photos in respect to this theme is that they go directly against the idea of serendipity. It doesn''t take a lot of imagination to stage a photograph involving found money. However, it is a moderately interesting composition on an abstract level so this photographer has done it a little better than the others I''ve rated.</td>', 'This is the third staged photograph  I''ve come across involoving an unlikely (i.e. unbelievable) discovery of cash. My problem with these staged photos in respect to this theme is that they go directly against the idea of serendipity. It doesn''t take a lot of imagination to stage a photograph involving found money. However, it is a moderately interesting composition on an abstract level so this photographer has done it a little better than the others I''ve rated.', '2004-04-27 13:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(687483, 70584, 7322, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract composition in spite of the obviously staged moment but I don''t know what that glassy thing is so it hasn''t quite made the statement the photographer was hoping for.</td>', 'I like the abstract composition in spite of the obviously staged moment but I don''t know what that glassy thing is so it hasn''t quite made the statement the photographer was hoping for.', '2004-04-27 13:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(687487, 70827, 3569, '<td valign="top">to me a sleeping cat is everyday, thus hard to see serendipity.  2</td>', 'to me a sleeping cat is everyday, thus hard to see serendipity.  2', '2004-04-27 13:59:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(687488, 71282, 7322, '<td valign="top">The photographer caught the geese in the act of ''goose stepping'' so to speak so this photo works on a thematic level. Unfortunately, there is too much lack of contrast between the subject and the background to make this work as more than a humorous snapshot. That can''t be entirely blamed on the photographer since they had to work with the limitations of the surroundings but the geese just aren''t sharply focused enough.</td>', 'The photographer caught the geese in the act of ''goose stepping'' so to speak so this photo works on a thematic level. Unfortunately, there is too much lack of contrast between the subject and the background to make this work as more than a humorous snapshot. That can''t be entirely blamed on the photographer since they had to work with the limitations of the surroundings but the geese just aren''t sharply focused enough.', '2004-04-27 13:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(687489, 71074, 15919, '<td valign="top">He or she seems to be pretty happy with it, good capture.  It´s nice image thou it may lack a litle sharpness.</td>', 'He or she seems to be pretty happy with it, good capture.  It´s nice image thou it may lack a litle sharpness.', '2004-04-27 14:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(687490, 71294, 3569, '<td valign="top">Rather boring and not much to define serendipity here.  2</td>', 'Rather boring and not much to define serendipity here.  2', '2004-04-27 14:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(687491, 71312, 3569, '<td valign="top">focus is appears to be off to me, subject is either flower or bee, not sure which meets the serendipity subject. 2</td>', 'focus is appears to be off to me, subject is either flower or bee, not sure which meets the serendipity subject. 2', '2004-04-27 14:01:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(687494, 70718, 15919, '<td valign="top">That I´ve often seen done so I dont know if the idea is very original.  But the image is ok and I like how you´ve captured the movement of the hammer withou much blurr.  The bolt could be sharper and maybe better focused, maybe it just needs a litle USM.</td>', 'That I´ve often seen done so I dont know if the idea is very original.  But the image is ok and I like how you´ve captured the movement of the hammer withou much blurr.  The bolt could be sharper and maybe better focused, maybe it just needs a litle USM.', '2004-04-27 14:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(687498, 71149, 15919, '<td valign="top">Great sky you´ve captured and the bird (or what it is flying there) gives it a lot thou maybe it´s pretty hard to recoginse unless you look carefully.</td>', 'Great sky you´ve captured and the bird (or what it is flying there) gives it a lot thou maybe it´s pretty hard to recoginse unless you look carefully.', '2004-04-27 14:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(687503, 71107, 7322, '<td valign="top">This image works overall, despite some focus problems. By placing the subject in the upper right corner and cropping out any distracting details, the photograhper shows they know their stuff. It really works on a compositional level. It looks as though the photographer was trying hard to get the relfection in sharp focus and overlooked the fact that the girls face and most of her jacket were out of focus. I can''t help feel an opportunity was lost when they photographer failed to make the contrast of the red of her jacket and the wet blacktop the main focus. My choice would have been to sacrifice some loss of sharpness in the reflection for more focus on the girl''s face. The girl''s expression, the sharp contrast of the black-and-white polka dot boots and the swirls in the reflection almost make up for it. Overall, this is the best I''ve seen so far and I would like to see more by this photographer. Kudos!</td>', 'This image works overall, despite some focus problems. By placing the subject in the upper right corner and cropping out any distracting details, the photograhper shows they know their stuff. It really works on a compositional level. It looks as though the photographer was trying hard to get the relfection in sharp focus and overlooked the fact that the girls face and most of her jacket were out of focus. I can''t help feel an opportunity was lost when they photographer failed to make the contrast of the red of her jacket and the wet blacktop the main focus. My choice would have been to sacrifice some loss of sharpness in the reflection for more focus on the girl''s face. The girl''s expression, the sharp contrast of the black-and-white polka dot boots and the swirls in the reflection almost make up for it. Overall, this is the best I''ve seen so far and I would like to see more by this photographer. Kudos!', '2004-04-27 14:07:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(687505, 71283, 7322, '<td valign="top">These clouds look like they''re moving fast and the photographer snapped the shot in time to get the contrast of the orange against the blue against the black silouhette of the trees. It doesn''t look manipulated so I''m inclined to believe it is an honest moment of serendipity. I like it.</td>', 'These clouds look like they''re moving fast and the photographer snapped the shot in time to get the contrast of the orange against the blue against the black silouhette of the trees. It doesn''t look manipulated so I''m inclined to believe it is an honest moment of serendipity. I like it.', '2004-04-27 14:08:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(687508, 70909, 7322, '<td valign="top">Ooh! If only this were focused more tightly! I want to like this photo more because it is an honest moment of serendipity captured by the photographer. Sadly, it is just to unclear at first what is going on. I give high marks for effort.</td>', 'Ooh! If only this were focused more tightly! I want to like this photo more because it is an honest moment of serendipity captured by the photographer. Sadly, it is just to unclear at first what is going on. I give high marks for effort.', '2004-04-27 14:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(687510, 70943, 15919, '<td valign="top">The idea may not be very original but the performance of it is pretty good.  Strange to see the quantitative movment of the apple but not just continious movment as you would expect to see on a film, nice effect.  Like the expression of the face of your model and I asume that you´ve had a lot of fun performing this.  Did it fall on his head?<br/>It´s a same that the guy isn´t very sharp and I think that this image is going to suffer for that.  Dont know if it´s something technical by your hand or if there is litle bit of a movement on the model in you long exposure.</td>', 'The idea may not be very original but the performance of it is pretty good.  Strange to see the quantitative movment of the apple but not just continious movment as you would expect to see on a film, nice effect.  Like the expression of the face of your model and I asume that you´ve had a lot of fun performing this.  Did it fall on his head?It´s a same that the guy isn´t very sharp and I think that this image is going to suffer for that.  Dont know if it´s something technical by your hand or if there is litle bit of a movement on the model in you long exposure.', '2004-04-27 14:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(687514, 70999, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a nice effort at spotting an honest serendipidous moment. I like the abstract quality of the image. It looks as though the flowers are tumbling through the composition. The little daisies in the bottom don''t stand out and there isn''t enough contrast for the abstraction to work. Nice effort!</td>', 'This is a nice effort at spotting an honest serendipidous moment. I like the abstract quality of the image. It looks as though the flowers are tumbling through the composition. The little daisies in the bottom don''t stand out and there isn''t enough contrast for the abstraction to work. Nice effort!', '2004-04-27 14:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(687517, 71208, 15919, '<td valign="top">Technically very well done, fine idea which suits the challenge and I like how the title supports the imge but isn´t trying to force some meening into it.  Very good image.</td>', 'Technically very well done, fine idea which suits the challenge and I like how the title supports the imge but isn´t trying to force some meening into it.  Very good image.', '2004-04-27 14:13:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(687519, 71329, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting and mysterious image, even if it is staged as I suspect. I guess the moral is, if you are going to stage it, put some imagination into it. I''m not sure what the glowing object is, which is mysterious part. I like the composition and the choice of sepia for this image. I''m not sure if it captures a serendipidous moment but I like the photo very much.</td>', 'This is an interesting and mysterious image, even if it is staged as I suspect. I guess the moral is, if you are going to stage it, put some imagination into it. I''m not sure what the glowing object is, which is mysterious part. I like the composition and the choice of sepia for this image. I''m not sure if it captures a serendipidous moment but I like the photo very much.', '2004-04-27 14:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(687522, 71317, 15919, '<td valign="top">I´m not getting the idea.  It seems litle underexposed which makes all the colors grayish and dull.  Also it dosen´t seem very sharp.  Don´t get offended, I´m just beeing honest.</td>', 'I´m not getting the idea.  It seems litle underexposed which makes all the colors grayish and dull.  Also it dosen´t seem very sharp.  Don´t get offended, I´m just beeing honest.', '2004-04-27 14:16:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(687526, 71085, 7322, '<td valign="top">Okay, someone else has done this and I gave them good marks for the imagination and execution. Now, I''m thinking, maybe not so original? But this one actually was more successfull--it really works despite the stagieness because of how carefully it was executed. The sharp focus on the diamond and the strand of albumen clinging to the eggshell make it appear possible that the gem came from the egg. The composition is tight with nice contrast between the bright yellow of the yolk, the white shell, and the black pan. Really nice effort!</td>', 'Okay, someone else has done this and I gave them good marks for the imagination and execution. Now, I''m thinking, maybe not so original? But this one actually was more successfull--it really works despite the stagieness because of how carefully it was executed. The sharp focus on the diamond and the strand of albumen clinging to the eggshell make it appear possible that the gem came from the egg. The composition is tight with nice contrast between the bright yellow of the yolk, the white shell, and the black pan. Really nice effort!', '2004-04-27 14:17:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(687530, 70659, 7322, '<td valign="top">This photographer definitely captured a serendipidous moment and did it well. I would have liked to have seen more contrast between the trees and the sky but I realize the photographer was intent on capturing the jet trail in the sky. They certainly could go back and tweak this in Photoshop after the contest. This could be a nice candidate for some interesting filters.</td>', 'This photographer definitely captured a serendipidous moment and did it well. I would have liked to have seen more contrast between the trees and the sky but I realize the photographer was intent on capturing the jet trail in the sky. They certainly could go back and tweak this in Photoshop after the contest. This could be a nice candidate for some interesting filters.', '2004-04-27 14:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(687541, 71000, 7322, '<td valign="top">Yet another staged shot of unexpected cash. But a good one I confess. The best I''ve seen of the four I''ve seen so far. I like the somewhat sinister quality that B&amp;W gives this, particularly because of the shadow in the top left corner. It makes one think of the superstition about ''found money bringing bad luck''. Because of that, and in spite of the staginess, I give this one high marks. If the photographer didn''t intend the sinister quality then an actual serendipidous moment could be said to have occured.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-04-28 01:42:31.</i></td>', 'Yet another staged shot of unexpected cash. But a good one I confess. The best I''ve seen of the four I''ve seen so far. I like the somewhat sinister quality that B&W gives this, particularly because of the shadow in the top left corner. It makes one think of the superstition about ''found money bringing bad luck''. Because of that, and in spite of the staginess, I give this one high marks. If the photographer didn''t intend the sinister quality then an actual serendipidous moment could be said to have occured.', '2004-04-27 14:26:11.000000', '2004-04-28 02:42:31.000000', 1),
(687545, 71082, 7322, '<td valign="top">A very nice composition, this rates on a technical and overall aesthetic level. I just don''t get it in terms of the theme.</td>', 'A very nice composition, this rates on a technical and overall aesthetic level. I just don''t get it in terms of the theme.', '2004-04-27 14:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(687547, 71305, 7322, '<td valign="top">Very striking and original image. High marks on aesthetic and technical merits but I don''t get the serendipidous quality.</td>', 'Very striking and original image. High marks on aesthetic and technical merits but I don''t get the serendipidous quality.', '2004-04-27 14:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(687572, 71262, 15919, '<td valign="top">Dont get the idea.  The angel is fine and the redish color gives it some feeling.  But the image is unsharp and maybe incorectly focused.</td>', 'Dont get the idea.  The angel is fine and the redish color gives it some feeling.  But the image is unsharp and maybe incorectly focused.', '2004-04-27 14:51:54.000000', NULL, 1),
