(687590, 71308, 13035, '<td valign="top">What a nice entry.  It''s hard to find a whole to constructively critiqu.  I might have put the horizon line a lower in the frame.  A little more sky, and a little less water.  You have the space.  The water is very dark at the lower boerder, and you don''t pick up the detail in the rocks for a few centimeters.  Give this void back to the sky.  Just a lovely picture.  8</td>', 'What a nice entry.  It''s hard to find a whole to constructively critiqu.  I might have put the horizon line a lower in the frame.  A little more sky, and a little less water.  You have the space.  The water is very dark at the lower boerder, and you don''t pick up the detail in the rocks for a few centimeters.  Give this void back to the sky.  Just a lovely picture.  8', '2004-04-27 15:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
