(688196, 71102, 7969, '<td valign="top">The black squirrel is quite common in vancouver actually, the sependipity of this shot was all the squirrels, i was trying to lure him over with some bird seed, and he was edging towards me, but then this other family threw him this huge cracker.  I wasn''t trying for serendipity but when got home realized it was there.   : )<br/>thanks for the votes and glad i got to show many of you the rare cajuned squirrel  :  )</td>', 'The black squirrel is quite common in vancouver actually, the sependipity of this shot was all the squirrels, i was trying to lure him over with some bird seed, and he was edging towards me, but then this other family threw him this huge cracker.  I wasn''t trying for serendipity but when got home realized it was there.   : )thanks for the votes and glad i got to show many of you the rare cajuned squirrel  :  )', '2004-04-28 01:03:29.000000', NULL, 0),
