(688630, 71305, 888, '<td valign="top">I didn''t get to vote on all the images for this challenge and so I didn''t see yours.<br/> <br/>Very nice but...<br/> <br/>my only concern is the use of somebody elses image in your photograph.  I''m not suggesting it breaks the literal representation of art rule, but as to whether or not you can use a (possibly) copyrighted image in your photo.<br/> <br/>I would probably have scored it an 8 by the way (but submitted it for DW just to be safe :-) )</td>', 'I didn''t get to vote on all the images for this challenge and so I didn''t see yours. Very nice but... my only concern is the use of somebody elses image in your photograph.  I''m not suggesting it breaks the literal representation of art rule, but as to whether or not you can use a (possibly) copyrighted image in your photo. I would probably have scored it an 8 by the way (but submitted it for DW just to be safe :-) )', '2004-04-28 06:52:47.000000', NULL, 0),
