(688653, 70629, 18433, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all that commented.  <br/> <br/>This is a simple point and shoot photo, pure serendipity ;-).  I was sitting in the cockpit (i am a pilot) when I saw this one comming.  Shot 3 photos blindly, 2 of them had bad reflections, this one turned out ok, the colour was a bit blotchy though so i choose bw.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-04-28 06:40:03.</i></td>', 'Thanks to all that commented.   This is a simple point and shoot photo, pure serendipity ;-).  I was sitting in the cockpit (i am a pilot) when I saw this one comming.  Shot 3 photos blindly, 2 of them had bad reflections, this one turned out ok, the colour was a bit blotchy though so i choose bw.', '2004-04-28 07:39:49.000000', '2004-04-28 07:40:03.000000', 0),
