(689031, 71107, 9462, '<td valign="top">Hi Everybody!<br/>YAY I made the top 5 :)<br/> <br/>Some sad news is that I didn''t have my date / time set within my camera for this very "Serendipitous" shot. So of course I will be disqualified. Oh well... at least I know I''m getting better at pleasing the very picky DPC crowd and that it is possible for me to reach the top 10 even with my little point and shoot. <br/> <br/>Thanks for all the wonderful... and not so wonderful comments.<br/> <br/><b>PLEASE</b> make sure you''re date/time is set within your camera! <br/> <br/>Aloha!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-04-28 11:41:24.</i></td>', 'Hi Everybody!YAY I made the top 5 :) Some sad news is that I didn''t have my date / time set within my camera for this very "Serendipitous" shot. So of course I will be disqualified. Oh well... at least I know I''m getting better at pleasing the very picky DPC crowd and that it is possible for me to reach the top 10 even with my little point and shoot.  Thanks for all the wonderful... and not so wonderful comments. PLEASE make sure you''re date/time is set within your camera!  Aloha!', '2004-04-28 12:40:18.000000', '2004-04-28 12:41:24.000000', 0),
