(691635, 71107, 10858, '<td valign="top">Hi Kali, let me congratulate you on the "purple ribbon" and a great shot. You are a great example for that it''s not always the camera, but the photographer and imagination what makes a good photo. I love all the negative space you have included here, and the expressions on the girl''s face. Way to gooo! :-)</td>', 'Hi Kali, let me congratulate you on the "purple ribbon" and a great shot. You are a great example for that it''s not always the camera, but the photographer and imagination what makes a good photo. I love all the negative space you have included here, and the expressions on the girl''s face. Way to gooo! :-)', '2004-04-30 10:48:16.000000', NULL, 0),
